"source":"feat","featName":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.2d680cc46a7972da"}}},{"_id":"4ccd6f79d79e9d1b","name":"Born Leader","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Naval Officer","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Prerequisites: Charisma 13, Intelligence 13, When you are the Commander of a Capital Ship, calculate its Reflex Defense using your Heroic Level plus one-half the ship's armor bonus (rounded down), the Pilot's Heroic Level, or the ship's Armor bonus, whichever is highest. In addition, all Gunners on your ship add one-half your Heroic Level, or one-half their Heroic Level, whichever is more, to damage rolls with Vehicle Weapons. Finally, you treat any generic crew as being one quality level higher (maximum of Ace, see Crew Quality).","description":"Prerequisites: Charisma 13, Intelligence 13, When you are the Commander of a Capital Ship, calculate its Reflex Defense using your Heroic Level plus one-half the ship's armor bonus (rounded down), the Pilot's Heroic Level, or the ship's Armor bonus, whichever is highest. In addition, all Gunners on your ship add one-half your Heroic Level, or one-half their Heroic Level, whichever is more, to damage rolls with Vehicle Weapons. Finally, you treat any generic crew as being one quality level higher (maximum of Ace, see Crew Quality).","class":"Noble","costNumeric":null,"category":"Noble","tree":"Naval Officer","treeId":"057a978a7dc1d5a7","tags":["armor","defender","noble","striker","support","sustained-damage"]},"effects":[{"_id":"f9275c38-3cb5-4ab3-aaa5-25e5722dcdd3","name":"Born Leader","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.defenses.will","mode":2,"value":"1"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Born Leader"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.born_leader"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.6a66ba6e0834dd6f"}}},{"_id":"4b2b45303c22cc56","name":"Distant Command","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Leadership","prerequisites":"Born Leader","benefit":"You do not lose Born Leader’s benefits if out of line of sight.","description":"Born Leader remains active even when allies are not in line of sight.","class":"Noble","costNumeric":null,"category":"Noble","tree":"Leadership","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","id":"swse.talent.born_leader"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"5964237d22681dc0","tags":["feat-chain","noble","talent-chain"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.distant_command"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.64fa257cd511314d"}}},{"_id":"7c21b2c52d11d504","name":"Draw Fire","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Disgrace","prerequisites":"","benefit":"You may not gain the benefit of this Talent if another character within 6 squares of you has used this talent since the end of your last turn. You may not use this Talent in the same round as the Soldier's Talent.","description":"You may not gain the benefit of this Talent if another character within 6 squares of you has used this talent since the end of your last turn. You may not use this Talent in the same round as the Soldier's Talent.","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","tree":"Disgrace","treeId":"e91cc675fbf9ba6e","tags":["positioning","soldier","sustained-damage"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.draw_fire"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.f29d5c0628459c94"}}},{"_id":"e77e53d4c1ea50ac","name":"Harm's Way","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Protection","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Whenever you take damage on behalf of an ally through the use of a Talent (including ), you gain Damage Reduction equal to your Class Level until the end of your next turn. Whenever you take damage on behalf of an ally through the use of a Talent (including ), your Damage Threshold is increased by 5 points. As a Swift Action, designate one adjacent ally. Until the end of your next turn, as long as that ally remains adjacent to you, you are considered to be providing that ally with Soft Cover against all attacks.","description":"Whenever you take damage on behalf of an ally through the use of a Talent (including ), you gain Damage Reduction equal to your Class Level until the end of your next turn. Whenever you take damage on behalf of an ally through the use of a Talent (including ), your Damage Threshold is increased by 5 points. As a Swift Action, designate one adjacent ally. Until the end of your next turn, as long as that ally remains adjacent to you, you are considered to be providing that ally with Soft Cover against all attacks.","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"skillTrained","skill":"cb5493f65f0bdb62"}],"_source":"fix5F-canonical"},"tree":"Protection","treeId":"c92c2cbc79b8a515","tags":["action-economy","damage-reduction","defender","mobility","positioning","soldier","striker","support"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.harms_way"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.fde8157b6d097e12"}}},{"_id":"e8c339aa3982fa32","name":"Tough as Nails","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Commando","prerequisites":"","benefit":"You can Catch a Second Wind as a Reaction, instead of as a Swift Action. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide When you use the Aid Another Action to Suppress an Enemy, that enemy takes a -5 penalty on its next attack instead of the normal -2 penalty. Only 1 character may gain the benefits of this Talent against a given target at a time. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions","description":"You can Catch a Second Wind as a Reaction, instead of as a Swift Action. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide When you use the Aid Another Action to Suppress an Enemy, that enemy takes a -5 penalty on its next attack instead of the normal -2 penalty. Only 1 character may gain the benefits of this Talent against a given target at a time. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","tree":"Commando","treeId":"798ed0945cbdac1c","tags":["action-economy","mobility","soldier"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.tough_as_nails"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.916b0a6197bf85a6"}}},{"_id":"9b13274cbbdb0f6f","name":"Unarmed","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"1d6+6","damageType":"kinetic","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":1,"cost":0,"equipped":true,"description":"","properties":[],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"simple","proficiency":"simple","subcategory":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"placeholder":true,"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":9,"flatDamageFormula":"1d6+6","useFlat":true}}}},{"_id":"7c8a374b8aefa069","name":"Blaster Pistol","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"3d6+4","damageType":"energy","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"dex","range":"ranged","weight":1,"cost":500,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>The standard sidearm used throughout the galaxy. Reliable, common, and effective at close to medium range.</p>","properties":[],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"ranged","proficiency":"pistols