r_Check_Penalty\" title=\"Armor Check Penalty\">Armor Check Penalty</a> while wearing <a href=\"/wiki/Light_Armor\" title=\"Light Armor\">Light Armor</a>."}},"effects":[{"_id":"9781a3c7-4e7e-4af0-9dcc-cdea0524b414","name":"Armor Proficiency (Light)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.armorProficiency.light","mode":5,"value":"true"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Armor Proficiency (Light)","effectType":"armor_proficiency"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.773ec00effc7e96f"}}},{"_id":"0320f4b129240bfb","name":"Armor Proficiency (medium)","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You are proficient with medium armor and do not take armor check penalties on attack rolls.","prerequisite":"Armor Proficiency (Light)","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":85,"tags":["armor","defender","feat-chain","non-force","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"No penalty on attacks and no <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Armor_Check_Penalty\" title=\"Armor Check Penalty\">Armor Check Penalty</a> while wearing <a href=\"/wiki/Light_Armor\" title=\"Light Armor\">Light Armor</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armor\" title=\"Medium Armor\">Medium Armor</a>."}},"effects":[{"_id":"af0983df-e771-4593-8f88-f0aa43612597","name":"Armor Proficiency (Medium)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.armorProficiency.medium","mode":5,"value":"true"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Armor Proficiency (Medium)","effectType":"armor_proficiency"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.d445051370a88a7f"}}},{"_id":"3fb9e5a9a6692110","name":"Charging Fire","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You may make a ranged attack at the end of a charge, taking a -2 penalty on the attack roll.","prerequisite":"Point Blank Shot","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Galaxy at War","page":24,"tags":["feat-chain","mobility","non-force","positioning","ranged","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Make ranged attack at end of a <a href=\"/wiki/Charge\" title=\"Charge\">Charge</a>; take a -2 penalty to <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a>."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"bab","min":4}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.a945e2f5ffb5a7ed"}}},{"_id":"0e3f6d2b52c9aacc","name":"Coordinated Attack","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"When you and an ally both attack the same target in the same round, you each gain a +1 bonus to attack rolls against that target.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":85,"tags":["noble","non-force","soldier","striker","support","sustained-damage"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Noble"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Automatic success with <a href=\"/wiki/Aid_Another\" title=\"Aid Another\">Aid Another</a> action at Point-Blank <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Range\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"bab","min":2}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[{"_id":"64b1c39a-2f16-43e4-aa8b-0ee213caf7a2","name":"Coordinated Attack","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Coordinated Attack","effectType":"combat_bonus","requiresCustomLogic":true}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.964f0781b3e3fc37"}}},{"_id":"94f75f334bd943d3","name":"Dual Weapon Mastery I","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You reduce the penalty for fighting with two weapons by 2.","prerequisite":"Dex 13, Two-Weapon Fighting","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":86,"tags":["damage-reduction","dual-wield","feat-chain","non-force","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Take a -5 penalty on attacks when attacking with two weapons, or both ends of a double weapon."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"attribute","ability":"dex","min":13},{"type":"bab","min":1}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[{"_id":"5e1f7aa0-8f41-4f6e-9a16-1710b2de25e9","name":"Dual Weapon Mastery I","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Dual Weapon Mastery I","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Dual Weapon Mastery I"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.84d8866a57381620"}}},{"_id":"442bffb9407c3755","name":"Dual Weapon Mastery II","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You reduce the penalty for fighting with two weapons by an additional 2.","prerequisite":"Dual Weapon Mastery I","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":86,"tags":["damage-reduction","dual-wield","feat-chain","non-force","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Take a -2 penalty on attacks when attacking with two weapons, or both ends of a double weapon."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"attribute","ability":"dex","min":15},{"type":"bab","min":6}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[{"_id":"fa217f33-b718-45d3-b256-9226da60389d","name":"Dual Weapon Mastery II","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Dual Weapon Mastery II","effectType":"special","requiresCustomLogic":true}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.c7c99a77ebee1c0c"}}},{"_id":"176b6300adbf40e7","name":"Improved Defenses","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You gain a +1 bonus to your Reflex, Fortitude, and Will Defense.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["defender","noble","non-force","scout","soldier","striker"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout","Noble"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Gain +1 bonus to all <a href=\"/wiki/Defenses\" title=\"Defenses\">Defenses</a>."}},"effects":[{"name":"Improved Defenses","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.defenses.reflex.bonus","mode":2,"value":"1","priority":20}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"transfer":true,"flags":{"swse":{"type":"defense-bonus","defense":"reflex"}}},{"name":"Improved Defenses","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.defenses.fortitude.bonus","mode":2,"value":"1","priority":20}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"transfer":true,"flags":{"swse":{"type":"defense-bonus","defense":"fortitude"}}},{"name":"Improved Defenses","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.defenses.will.bonus","mode":2,"value":"1","priority":20}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"transfer":true,"flags":{"swse":{"type":"defense-bonus","defense":"will"}}}],"fol