 Surprise Round, you and all allies within 6 squares of you gain a +1 morale bonus on attack rolls. Additionally, until the end of the encounter, you retain this bonus to attack rolls against any target you or your allies damage during the Surprise Round. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue You know how to use an opponent's strength against it. Whenever you successfully Grapple an opponent, you deal damage equal to the opponent's Strength modifier (minimum 1 point). Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide When you successfully Grab an opponent, they must use a Full-Round Action instead of a Standard Action to break the Grab. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy When your melee attack damages an opponent that is denied its Dexterity bonus to its Reflex Defense, that opponent cannot take Attacks of Opportunity until the end of its next turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide","description":"During the Surprise Round, you and all allies within 6 squares of you gain a +1 morale bonus on attack rolls. Additionally, until the end of the encounter, you retain this bonus to attack rolls against any target you or your allies damage during the Surprise Round. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue You know how to use an opponent's strength against it. Whenever you successfully Grapple an opponent, you deal damage equal to the opponent's Strength modifier (minimum 1 point). Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide When you successfully Grab an opponent, they must use a Full-Round Action instead of a Standard Action to break the Grab. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy When your melee attack damages an opponent that is denied its Dexterity bonus to its Reflex Defense, that opponent cannot take Attacks of Opportunity until the end of its next turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","tree":"Brawler","treeId":"67fdd8dce9abd6c1","tags":["action-economy","ambush","defender","leader","melee","positioning","soldier","striker","support","sustained-damage"]},"effects":[{"_id":"ae746f18-a3bb-4d9a-9d7c-b685d8b9a4e4","name":"Cantina Brawler","icon":"icons/svg/fist.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.attacks.unarmed","mode":2,"value":"2"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Cantina Brawler"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.cantina_brawler"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.430b73348460715e"}}},{"_id":"d26eb14c8e8f4680","name":"Counterpunch","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Brawler","prerequisites":null,"benefit":"When you fight defensively, any adjacent creature that attacks provokes an attack of opportunity from you.","description":"When you fight defensively, adjacent enemies provoke attacks of opportunity.","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","tree":"Brawler","treeId":"67fdd8dce9abd6c1","tags":["positioning","soldier"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.counterpunch"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.e1ac13b319b66c76"}}},{"_id":"71d85148365bbe3e","name":"Evasion","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Survivor","prerequisites":null,"benefit":"If hit by an area attack, take half or no damage.","description":"Take half or no damage from area attacks.","class":"Scout","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scout","tree":"Survivor","treeId":"9b06340233eb3cdd","tags":["battlefield-control","evasion","scout","striker"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.evasion"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.5400bc8cb1200624"}}},{"_id":"a0e2a97c3faeae2c","name":"Long Stride","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Master Scout","prerequisites":"Skill Focus (Initiative)","benefit":"Surefooted, Trained in Climb You do not suffer penalties when using the Accelerated Climbing application of the Climb Skill. In a Surprise Round, if you are not Surprised, you can take a Swift Action in addition to the one other Action normally allowed. If you are Surprised, you can take a single Swift Action. Normal: In a Surprise Round, if you are not Surprised, you can take a Standard Action, a Move Action, or a Swift Action. If you are Surprised, you can take no Actions.","description":"Surefooted, Trained in Climb You do not suffer penalties when using the Accelerated Climbing application of the Climb Skill. In a Surprise Round, if you are not Surprised, you can take a Swift Action in addition to the one other Action normally allowed. If you are Surprised, you can take a single Swift Action. Normal: In a Surprise Round, if you are not Surprised, you can take a Standard Action, a Move Action, or a Swift Action. If you are Surprised, you can take no Actions.","class":"Scout","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scout","tree":"Master Scout","treeId":"dca33c0215264a02","tags":["action-economy","ambush","controller","feat-chain","mobility","scout","striker","support","sustained-damage","talent-chain"]},"effects":[{"_id":"1379eb45-3cb6-42c3-aabe-c8747b8d5bf0","name":"Long Stride","icon":"icons/svg/running.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.speed","mode":2,"value":"2","priority":20}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Long Stride"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.long_stride"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.618472c99f355949"}}},{"_id":"a0cb5566f0055eb6","name":"Sucker Punch","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Brawler","prerequisites":null,"benefit":"If your me