rained</a> in one Class Skill."}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.a9f6de36f24ef202"}}},{"_id":"a74774bf8baa9068","name":"Weapon Finesse","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You may use your Dexterity modifier instead of Strength for attack rolls with light melee weapons.","prerequisite":"Dex 13","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":88,"tags":["feat-chain","melee","non-force","scoundrel","scout"],"bonus_feat_for":["Scout","Scoundrel"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Use <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> modifier instead of <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> modifier on attack rolls with Light Melee Weapons and <a href=\"/wiki/Lightsabers\" title=\"Lightsabers\">Lightsabers</a>."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"bab","min":1}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.252b67d6e31c377e"}}},{"_id":"8220811a31622716","name":"Weapon Focus","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You gain a +1 bonus on attack rolls with the selected weapon group.","prerequisite":"Proficient with selected weapon group","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":88,"tags":["feat-chain","non-force","soldier","striker"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"+1 bonus on attack rolls with chosen weapon."}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.c41814601364b643"}}},{"_id":"a3e5e35f0a36a92a","name":"Weapon Proficiency","type":"feat","