apon Proficiency (Rifles)","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You are proficient with rifles and do not take the -5 penalty when using them.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["non-force","ranged","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{}},"effects":[{"_id":"3b695d0d-747b-4081-8b6c-8b5f8584ff43","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.765ff8a34e58acac"}}},{"_id":"8e701c6d9314f05a","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You are proficient with simple weapons and do not take the -5 penalty when using them.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["noble","non-force","scoundrel","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout","Scoundrel","Noble"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{}},"effects":[{"_id":"220daaa7-e1b5-440d-98cd-10f5e586ef8b","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.2d680cc46a7972da"}}},{"_id":"9b758e10ecd6926c","name":"Acute Senses","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Master Scout","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Keen Shot You are skilled at fighting armored characters, taking advantage of their weaknesses. You can use each of the following Actions once per encounter: Binding Hit: You dislodge an enemy's Armor, causing it to hinder the wearer's defenses. Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If you hit and damage your target, the target loses its Armor bonus to its Reflex Defense and is Flat-Footed. This effect remains until the target spends a Standard Action to adjust its Armor. Blinding Fire: Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If the attack hits and damages the target, the target takes a -2 penalty to all attacks until the end of your next turn. Additionally, all other creatures, Droids, and Vehicles have Concealment from the target until the end of your next turn. Slowing Shot: Your hit damages your target's Armor so that the target's movement is hindered. Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If you hit and damage the target, the target's Speed is reduced by two squares until the end of your next turn.","description":"Keen Shot You are skilled at fighting armored characters, taking advantage of their weaknesses. You can use each of the following Actions once per encounter: Binding Hit: You dislodge an enemy's Armor, causing it to hinder the wearer's defenses. Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If you hit and damage your target, the target loses its Armor bonus to its Reflex Defense and is Flat-Footed. This effect remains until the target spends a Standard Action to adjust its Armor. Blinding Fire: Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If the attack hits and damages the target, the target takes a -2 penalty to all attacks until the end of your next turn. Additionally, all other creatures, Droids, and Vehicles have Concealment from the target until the end of your next turn. Slowing Shot: Your hit damages your target's Armor so that the target's movement is hindered. Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If you hit and damage the target, the target's Speed is reduced by two squares until the end of your next turn.","class":"Scout","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scout","tree":"Master Scout","treeId":"dca33c0215264a02","tags":["action-economy","armor","controller","damage-reduction","defender","force","force-control","force-defense","force-offense","melee","mobility","positioning","ranged","scout","striker","support"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.acute_senses"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.f0166d26d9f6252a"}}},{"_id":"2672589e0c728ebf","name":"Armored Defense","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Knight's Armor","prerequisites":"","benefit":"When calculating your Reflex Defense, you may add your Heroic Level plus one-half your Armor bonus (rounded down), or your Armor bonus alone, whichever is higher. This Talent counts as both the Talent and the Improved Talent for the purposes of prerequisites. You are adept at using a Cortosis Gauntlet to parry Lightsaber attacks. You gain a +2 bonus when making an opposed Unarmed melee attack roll against a Lightsaber attack.","description":"When calculating your Reflex Defense, you may add your Heroic Level plus one-half your Armor bonus (rounded down), or your Armor bonus alone, whichever is higher. This Talent counts as both the Talent and the Improved Talent for the purposes of prerequisites. You are adept at using a Cortosis Gauntlet to parry Lightsaber attacks. You gain a +2 bonus when making an opposed Unarmed melee attack roll against a Lightsaber attack.","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","tree":"Knight's Armor","treeId":"ea01d740c91888b3","tags":["armor","defender","lightsaber","melee","scaling","soldier","striker","sustained-damage","unarmed"]},"effects":[{"_id":"28f1f3db-0c6f-4614-bdcf-000f1542a25b","name":"Armored Defense","icon":"icons/svg/shield.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.defenses.reflex.misc","mode":2,"value":"1","priority":20}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Armored Defense"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.armored_defense"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.4c236343b01ea763"}}},{"_id":"46424a6ff0b87320","name":"Hunter's Mark","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Bounty Hunter","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Once per encounter as a Free Action, you may designate an opponent. For the rest of the encounter, when you succeed on a melee or ranged attack against that opponent, you gain a bonus on damage equal to your Class Level. Your skill as a Bounty Hunter is known throughout the galaxy, even on fringe worlds. When you are not Disguised, you may reroll any Persuasion checks made to Intimidate, keeping the better of the two results. You may choose to reroll any Gather Information checks made to Locate Individual, but you must accept the result of the reroll, even if it is worse. Prerequisites: , Hunter's Target This Talent applies only to an opponent you've designated as your Hunter's Target. Any attack or effect originating from the target that would normally move you along the Condition Track does not, in fact, move you along the Condition Track. Prerequisites: , Hunter's Target Prerequisites: , Hunter's Target, Nowhere to Hide Prerequisites: , Hunter's Target","description":"Once per encounter as a Free Action, you may designate an opponent. For the rest of the encounter, when you succeed on a melee or ranged attack against that opponent, you gain a bonus on damage equal to your Class Level. Your skill as a Bounty Hunter is known throughout the galaxy, even on fringe worlds. When you are not Disguised, you may reroll any Persuasion checks made to Intimidate, keeping the better of the two results. You may choose to reroll any Gather Information checks made to Locate Individual, but you must accept the result of the reroll, even if it is worse. Prerequisites: , Hunter's Target This Talent applies only to an opponent you've designated as your Hunter's Target. Any attack or effect originating from the target that would normally move you along the Condition Track does not, in fact, move you along the Condition Track. Prerequisites: , Hunter's Target Prerequisites: , Hunter's Target, Nowhere to Hide Prerequisites: , Hunter's Target","class":"Bounty Hunter","costNumeric":null,"category":"Bounty Hunter","tree":"Bounty Hunter","treeId":"a47ed82a822e3962","tags":["action-economy","condition-removal","controller","dual-wield","melee","mobility","positioning","ranged","scoundrel","skills","social","stealth","striker","support"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.hunters_mark"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.74fb6b37af983a4c"}}},{"_id":"63254821a6d304b4","name":"Improved Armored Defense","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Armor Specialist","prerequisites":"Armored Defense","benefit":"Your Reflex Defense bonus equals either your heroic level + half your armor bonus, or your armor bonus.","description":"Your Reflex Defense bonus equals either your heroic level plus half your armor bonus or your armor bonus.","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","tree":"Armor Specialist","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","id":"swse.talent.armored_defense"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"17cec542331cb4e4","tags":["armor","defender","feat-chain","soldier","striker","talent-chain"]},"effects":[{"_id":"842ee02b-8f7e-4a40-802a-c6fe553379a5","name":"Improved Armored Defense","icon":"icons/svg/shield.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.defenses.reflex","mode":2,"value":"2"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Improved Armored Defense"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.improved_armored_defense"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.394809ed8baff1b9"}}},{"_id":"fec68bb982de090d","name":"Keen Shot","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Awareness","prerequisites":"Acute Senses","benefit":"Ignore penalties against opponents with concealment (except total concealment).","description":"Ignore concealment penalties except total concealment.","class":"Scout","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scout","tree":"Awareness","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","id":"swse.talent.acute_senses"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"1c48d1cd9ab1f5c8","tags":["feat-chain","ranged","scout","talent-chain"]},"effects":[{"_id":"ef19c1fd-23a5-4d9c-9a58-fbe2725f4f2c","name":"Keen Shot","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.ranged.concealmentPenalty","mode":5,"value":"0"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Keen Shot","effectType":"concealment_penalty"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.keen_shot"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.aca0598e9b0eb935"}}},{"_id":"7180d9ca4ef56100","name":"Multiattack Proficiency (pistols)","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Gunslinger","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Dual Weapon Mastery I, Weapon Focus (Pistols) Immediately after making a Full Attack where you attack with two Pistols, you may move up to your Speed as a Free Action. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue You are a master of the elegant, if archaic, custom of dueling with Pistols. You can use each of the following Actions once per encounter as a Standard Action: End Game: You make a single ranged attack with a Pistol against an opponent within Range. The opponent's Damage Threshold is halved (rounded down) for the purpose of this attack. Snap Aiming: You make a single ranged attack with the benefits of Aiming. Stand Ready: You gain a +4 bonus to your Reflex Defense until the end of your next turn and make a single ranged attack. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy If you are within 6 squares of a target and are armed with a Pistol or a Rifle, you can act as though you occupied the nearest square adjacent to the target for purposes of determining whether or not you or any allies are Flanking that target. You may only be considered to be Flanking a single target at a time. You must spend a Swift Action on your turn to designate the target you Flank at range. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions When moving away from a pursuing target, if you either Run or use two Move Actions during this turn, you can make a single ranged attack with a -5 penalty as part of your Move Action. You can spend a Force Point to avoid the penalty. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions","description":"Dual Weapon Mastery I, Weapon Focus (Pistols) Immediately after making a Full Attack where you attack with two Pistols, you may move up to your Speed as a Free Action. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue You are a master of the elegant, if archaic, custom of dueling with Pistols. You can use each of the following Actions once per encounter as a Standard Action: End Game: You make a single ranged attack with a Pistol against an opponent within Range. The opponent's Damage Threshold is halved (rounded down) for the purpose of this attack. Snap Aiming: You make a single ranged attack with the benefits of Aiming. Stand Ready: You gain a +4 bonus to your Reflex Defense until the end of your next turn and make a single ranged attack. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy If you are within 6 squares of a target and are armed with a Pistol or a Rifle, you can act as though you occupied the nearest square adjacent to the target for purposes of determining whether or not you or any allies are Flanking that target. You may only be considered to be Flanking a single target at a time. You must spend a Swift Action on your turn to designate the target you Flank at range. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions When moving away from a pursuing target, if you either Run or use two Move Actions during this turn, you can make a single ranged attack with a -5 penalty as part of your Move Action. You can spend a Force Point to avoid the penalty. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions","class":"Gunslinger","costNumeric":null,"category":"Gunslinger","tree":"Gunslinger","treeId":"cb6f775cd227a3e3","tags":["action-economy","controller","defender","dual-wield","evasion","force","force-control","force-defense","force-offense","mobility","positioning","ranged","striker","sustained-damage"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.multiattack_proficiency_pistols"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.b812c197daea93fd"}}},{"_id":"857b3140dd71d4c5","name":"Notorious","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Bounty Hunter","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Your skill as a bounty hunter is known throughout the galaxy, even on fringe worlds. When you are not disguised, you may reroll any Persuasion checks made to intimidate others, keeping the better result.","description":"Your skill as a bounty hunter is known throughout the galaxy, even on fringe worlds. When you are not disguised, you may reroll any Persuasion checks made to intimidate others, keeping the better result.","class":"Bounty Hunter","costNumeric":null,"category":"Bounty Hunter","tree":"Bounty Hunter","treeId":"a47ed82a822e3962","tags":["leader","scoundrel","skills","social","striker","support"],"summary":"When not disguised, reroll Persuasion checks to intimidate and keep the better result.","source":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":209},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.c67cbd59abd1cc53"}}},{"_id":"cb42d0cbb5649d7d","name":"Vibroblade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"2d6+9","damageType":"kinetic","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":2,"cost":500,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>A blade weapon enhanced with ultrasonic vibrations that increase its cutting power.</p>\n      <p><strong>Special:</strong> Vibroweapon. Critical threat range 19-20.</p>","properties":["Vibroweapon","Critical 19-20"],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"melee","proficiency":"advanced-melee","subcategory":"advanced","costNumeric":500,"category":"advanced"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.weapons.weapon-vibroblade"},"swse":{"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":15,"flatDamageFormula":"2d6+9","useFlat":true}}}},{"_id":"574be30bf7dfe751","name":"Blaster Pistol","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"3d6+7","damageType":"energy","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"dex","range":"ranged","weight":1,"cost":500,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>The standard sidearm used throughout the galaxy. Reliable, common, and effective at close to medium range.</p>","properties":[],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"ranged","proficiency":"pistols","subcategory":"pistol","costNumeric":500,"category":"pistol"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.weapons.weapon-blaster-pistol"},"swse":{"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":14,"flatDamageFormula":"3d6+7","useFlat":true}}}},{"_id":"60d8d0c29b8ae247","name":"Blaster Pistol","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"3d6+7","damageType":"energy","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"dex","range":"ranged","weight":1,"cost":500,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>The standard sidearm used throughout the galaxy. Reliable, common, and effective at close to medium range.</p>","properties":[],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"ranged","proficiency":"pistols","subcategory":"pistol","costNumeric":500,"category":"pistol"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.weapons.weapon-blaster-pistol"},"swse":{"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":14,"flatDamageFormula":"3d6+7","useFlat":true}}}},{"_id":"f0b08c2a97c49422","name":"Blaster Pistol","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"3d6+7","damageType":"energy","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"dex","range":"ranged","weight":1,"cost":500,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>The standard sidearm used throughout the galaxy. Reliable, common, and effective at close to medium range.</p>","properties":[],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"ranged","proficiency":"pistols","subcategory":"pistol","costNumeric":500,"category":"pistol"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.weapons.weapon-blaster-pistol"},"swse":{"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":14,"flatDamageFormula":"3d6+7","useFlat":true}}}},{"_id":"3521c62a0e54f610","name":"Stun Grenade (4)","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"4d6+6(Stun),2-SquareBurst","damageType":"stun","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"dex","range":"ranged","weight":0.5,"cost":150,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>A non-lethal grenade that releases a burst of stunning energy.</p>\n      <p><strong>Special:</strong> 2-square radius burst. Fortitude save DC 15 or take full stun damage and be dazed 1 round. Half damage on save.</p>","properties":["Grenade","Area Effect","Stun","Non-Lethal","Single Use"],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"ranged","proficiency":"simple","subcategory":"grenade","costNumeric":150,"category":"grenade"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.weapons.weapon-stun-grenade"},"swse":{"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":14,"flatDamageFormula":"4d6+6(Stun),2-SquareBurst","useFlat":true}}}},{"_id":"4a6d5357b8b30d8e","name":"Thermal Detonator (2)","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"8d6+6,4-SquareBurst","damageType":"kinetic","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"dex","range":"ranged","weight":1,"cost":2000,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>An extremely powerful explosive device. Creates a massive blast that can level buildings.</p>\n      <p><strong>Special:</strong> 4-square radius burst. Reflex save DC 20 for half damage. Extremely dangerous and often illegal.</p>","properties":["Grenade","Area Effect","Explosive","Single Use","Restricted"],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"ranged","proficiency":"simple","subcategory":"grenade","costNumeric":2000,"category":"grenade"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.weapons.weapon-thermal-detonator"},"swse":{"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":14,"flatDamageFormula":"8d6+6,4-SquareBurst","useFlat":true}}}}],"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"import":{"source":"books","raw":{"Size":"Medium","Species":"Human","Nonheroic Level":0,"Class Levels":{"Scout":3,"Soldier":4,"Hunter":4,"Gunslinger":2},"Destiny Points":1,"Force Points":6,"Dark Side Points":6,"Initiative":12,"Senses":"Low-Light Vision, Perception +12","Languages":["Basic"],"Unassigned Languages":0,"Reflex Defense":33,"Flat-Footed Defense":32,"Fortitude Defense":31,"Will Defense":26,"Hit Points":113,"Damage Threshold":31,"Speed":"4 Squares","Melee Weapons":"Vibroblade +15 (2d6+9)","Ranged Weapons":"Blaster Pistol +14 (3d6+7), Blaster Pistol +14 (3d6+7) and Blaster Pistol +14 (3d6+7), Stun Grenade (4) +14 (4d6+6 ( Stun ), 2-Square Burst ), Thermal Detonator (2) +14 (8d6+6, 4-Square Burst )","Base Attack Bonus":12,"Grapple":15,"Attack Options":["Hunter's Mark","Keen Shot","Point-Blank Shot","Power Blast","Precise Shot"],"Special Actions":["Familiar Foe (+2)","Quick Draw"],"Force Powers":[],"Force Secrets":[],"Force Techniques":[],"Strength":16,"Dexterity":15,"Constitution":14,"Intelligence":10,"Wisdom":12,"Charisma":10,"Talents":["Talents : Acute Senses","Armored Defense","Hunter's Mark","Improved Armored Defense","Keen Shot","Multiattack Proficiency (Pistols)","Notorious"],"Feats":["Feats : Armor Proficiency (Light)","Armor Proficiency (Medium)","Armor Proficiency (Heavy)","Dual Weapon Mastery I","Dual Weapon Mastery II","Point-Blank Shot","Power Blast","Precise Shot","Quick Draw","Shake It Off","Weapon Proficiency (Advanced Melee Weapons)","Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)","Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)","Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"],"Skills":["Skills : Endurance","Initiative","Perception","must take second result)","Stealth","Survival","Treat Injury"],"Trained Skills":["Skills : Endurance","Initiative","Perception","must take second result)","Stealth","Survival","Treat Injury"],"Species Traits":[],"Gear":"Heavy Battle Armor (+10 Reflex , +4 Fortitude ), Heavy Energy Shields (SR 25; Verpine General Template , Prototype General Template ), Blaster Pistol (2), Vibroblade , Stun Grenade (4), Thermal Detonator (2), Low-Light Goggles (Low-Light Vision), 2000 credits"},"mode":"play","sourcePack":"heroic","sourceAuthority":"statblock","playReady":true,"normalizedForPlay":true,"playNormalizationVersion":1}}}}
