th simple weapons and do not take the -5 penalty when using them.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["noble","non-force","scoundrel","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout","Scoundrel","Noble"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{}},"effects":[{"_id":"220daaa7-e1b5-440d-98cd-10f5e586ef8b","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.2d680cc46a7972da"}}},{"_id":"be2e80cb96a037f0","name":"Born Leader","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Naval Officer","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Prerequisites: Charisma 13, Intelligence 13, When you are the Commander of a Capital Ship, calculate its Reflex Defense using your Heroic Level plus one-half the ship's armor bonus (rounded down), the Pilot's Heroic Level, or the ship's Armor bonus, whichever is highest. In addition, all Gunners on your ship add one-half your Heroic Level, or one-half their Heroic Level, whichever is more, to damage rolls with Vehicle Weapons. Finally, you treat any generic crew as being one quality level higher (maximum of Ace, see Crew Quality).","description":"Prerequisites: Charisma 13, Intelligence 13, When you are the Commander of a Capital Ship, calculate its Reflex Defense using your Heroic Level plus one-half the ship's armor bonus (rounded down), the Pilot's Heroic Level, or the ship's Armor bonus, whichever is highest. In addition, all Gunners on your ship add one-half your Heroic Level, or one-half their Heroic Level, whichever is more, to damage rolls with Vehicle Weapons. Finally, you treat any generic crew as being one quality level higher (maximum of Ace, see Crew Quality).","class":"Noble","costNumeric":null,"category":"Noble","tree":"Naval Officer","treeId":"057a978a7dc1d5a7","tags":["armor","defender","noble","striker","support","sustained-damage"]},"effects":[{"_id":"f9275c38-3cb5-4ab3-aaa5-25e5722dcdd3","name":"Born Leader","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.defenses.will","mode":2,"value":"1"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Born Leader"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.born_leader"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.6a66ba6e0834dd6f"}}},{"_id":"d7161a785c290a5e","name":"Inspire Confidence","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Inspiration","prerequisites":"","benefit":"You can't in yourself. As a Swift Action, you can encourage one of your allies within line of sight to make haste with a Skill Check. On that ally's next turn, that ally can make a Skill Check that normally requires a Standard Action, as a Move Action instead. Prerequisite: You can share your strength of will with your allies. Once per encounter as a Swift Action, you can grant all allies within line of sight a +2 morale bonus to their Will Defense. This bonus lasts for the remainder of the encounter, and once it is granted your allies need not remain within line of sight of you to retain this bonus.","description":"You can't in yourself. As a Swift Action, you can encourage one of your allies within line of sight to make haste with a Skill Check. On that ally's next turn, that ally can make a Skill Check that normally requires a Standard Action, as a Move Action instead. Prerequisite: You can share your strength of will with your allies. Once per encounter as a Swift Action, you can grant all allies within line of sight a +2 morale bonus to their Will Defense. This bonus lasts for the remainder of the encounter, and once it is granted your allies need not remain within line of sight of you to retain this bonus.","class":"Noble","costNumeric":null,"category":"Noble","tree":"Inspiration","treeId":"72d32ebcbb607314","tags":["action-economy","controller","defender","leader","mobility","noble","striker","support"]},"effects":[{"_id":"1faa089c-9609-46d8-8543-9a68ace3553b","name":"Inspire Confidence","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.attacks","mode":2,"value":"1"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Inspire Confidence"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.inspire_confidence"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.4d8882a28da30454"}}},{"_id":"7ed2e2976e4faa8e","name":"Melee Smash","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Melee Specialist","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Unrelenting Assault You twirl your Weapon around you in a blur, creating a circle of death around you. Any enemy target that begins its turn adjacent to you takes damage equal to your Strength bonus. You must be wielding a Melee Weapon to be using this Talent.","description":"Unrelenting Assault You twirl your Weapon around you in a blur, creating a circle of death around you. Any enemy target that begins its turn adjacent to you takes damage equal to your Strength bonus. You must be wielding a Melee Weapon to be using this Talent.","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","tree":"Melee Specialist","treeId":"fad8118981c532f0","tags":["melee","positioning","soldier","striker","sustained-damage"]},"effects":[{"_id":"2d692811-5c22-48b8-944d-45db89ca5e77","name":"Melee Smash","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.damage.melee","mode":5,"value":"half_level"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Melee Smash"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"