 the penalty increases to -2. Prerequisites: , I As , except that the penalty increases to -5. Your reputation as a Crime Lord is known throughout the galaxy, even on fringe worlds. When you are not Disguised, you may reroll any Persuasion checks made to Intimidate, keeping the better of the two results. Prerequisites: , I, II, Notorious Any opponent that is reduced to half Hit Points or fewer while within 6 squares of you takes a -2 penalty on all attack rolls and Skill Checks for the duration of the encounter. This is a Mind-Affecting Fear effect.","description":"As , except that the penalty increases to -2. Prerequisites: , I As , except that the penalty increases to -5. Your reputation as a Crime Lord is known throughout the galaxy, even on fringe worlds. When you are not Disguised, you may reroll any Persuasion checks made to Intimidate, keeping the better of the two results. Prerequisites: , I, II, Notorious Any opponent that is reduced to half Hit Points or fewer while within 6 squares of you takes a -2 penalty on all attack rolls and Skill Checks for the duration of the encounter. This is a Mind-Affecting Fear effect.","class":"Crime Lord","costNumeric":null,"category":"Crime Lord","tree":"Infamy","treeId":"c1be604242cb328f","tags":["damage-reduction","positioning","skills","social","striker"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.inspire_fear_i"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.cf4b1e5b126a2a7e"}}},{"_id":"b6624b39d09c436a","name":"Notorious","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Infamy","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Your reputation as a crime lord is known throughout the galaxy, even on fringe worlds. When you are not disguised, you may reroll any Persuasion checks made to intimidate others, keeping the better result.","description":"Your reputation as a crime lord is known throughout the galaxy, even on fringe worlds. When you are not disgu