h pistols and do not take the -5 penalty when using them.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["non-force","ranged","scoundrel","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout","Scoundrel"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{}},"effects":[{"_id":"04733e85-193e-4f4b-8792-c359083557d1","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.e5d361d01d1b44e4"}}},{"_id":"d5e29a4a605bd33f","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You are proficient with rifles and do not take the -5 penalty when using them.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["non-force","ranged","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{}},"effects":[{"_id":"3b695d0d-747b-4081-8b6c-8b5f8584ff43","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.765ff8a34e58acac"}}},{"_id":"ab487cbbf22342eb","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You are proficient with simple weapons and do not take the -5 penalty when using them.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["noble","non-force","scoundrel","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout","Scoundrel","Noble"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{}},"effects":[{"_id":"220daaa7-e1b5-440d-98cd-10f5e586ef8b","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.2d680cc46a7972da"}}},{"_id":"b3622a850f350677","name":"Acute Senses","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Master Scout","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Keen Shot You are skilled at fighting armored characters, taking advantage of their weaknesses. You can use each of the following Actions once per encounter: Binding Hit: You dislodge an enemy's Armor, causing it to hinder the wearer's defenses. Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If you hit and damage your target, the target loses its Armor bonus to its Reflex Defense and is Flat-Footed. This effect remains until the target spends a Standard Action to adjust its Armor. Blinding Fire: Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If the attack hits and damages the target, the target takes a -2 penalty to all attacks until the end of your next turn. Additionally, all other creatures, Droids, and Vehicles have Concealment from the target until the end of your next turn. Slowing Shot: Your hit damages your target's Armor so that the target's movement is hindered. Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If you hit and damage the target, the target's Speed is reduced by two squares until the end of your next turn.","description":"Keen Shot You are skilled at fighting armored characters, taking advantage of their weaknesses. You can use each of the following Actions once per encounter: Binding Hit: You dislodge an enemy's Armor, causing it to hinder the wearer's defenses. Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If you hit and damage your target, the target loses its Armor bonus to its Reflex Defense and is Flat-Footed. This effect remains until the target spends a Standard Action to adjust its Armor. Blinding Fire: Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If the attack hits and damages the target, the target takes a -2 penalty to all attacks until the end of your next turn. Additionally, all other creatures, Droids, and Vehicles have Concealment from the target until the end of your next turn. Slowing Shot: Your hit damages your target's Armor so that the target's movement is hindered. Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If you hit and damage the target, the target's Speed is reduced by two squares until the end of your next turn.","class":"Scout","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scout","tree":"Master Scout","treeId":"dca33c0215264a02","tags":["action-economy","armor","controller","damage-reduction","defender","force","force-control","force-defense","force-offense","melee","mobility","positioning","ranged","scout","striker","support"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.acute_senses"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.f0166d26d9f6252a"}}},{"_id":"ee3cf6fb93eebb89","name":"Harm's Way","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Protection","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Whenever you take damage on behalf of an ally through the use of a Talent (including ), you gain Damage Reduction equal to your Class Level until the end of your next turn. Whenever you take damage on behalf of an ally through the use of a Talent (including ), your Damage Threshold is increased by 5 points. As a Swift Action, designate one adjacent ally. Until the end of your next turn, as long as that ally remains adjacent to you, you are considered to be providing that ally with Soft Cover against all attacks.","description":"Whenever you take damage on behalf of an ally through the use of a Talent (including ), you gain Damage Reduction equal to your Class Level until the end of your next turn. Whenever you take damage on behalf of an ally through the use of a Talent (including ), your Damage Threshold is increased by 5 points. As a Swift Action, designate one adjacent ally. Until the end of your next turn, as long as that ally remains adjacent to you, you are considered to be providing that ally with Soft Cover against all attacks.","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"skillTrained","skill":"cb5493f65f0bdb62"}],"_source":"fix5F-canonical"},"tree":"Protection","treeId":"c92c2cbc79b8a515","tags":["action-economy","damage-reduction","defender","mobility","positioning","soldier","striker","support"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.harms_way"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.fde8157b6d097e12"}}},{"_id":"679c38fec6c2a236","name":"Penetrating Attack","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Weapon Master","prerequisites":"Weapon Focus (Chosen Weapon)","benefit":"This replaces the effects of the Talent. Choose one Exotic Weapon or weapon group with which you're proficient. You gain a +1 bonus on attack rolls with the chosen Exotic Weapon or weapon from the chosen group. This bonus stacks with the bonus granted by the Weapon Focus feat. You may select this Talent multiple times. Each time you select this Talent, it applies to a different Exotic Weapon or weapon group.","description":"This replaces the effects of the Talent. Choose one Exotic Weapon or weapon group with which you're proficient. You gain a +1 bonus on attack rolls with the chosen Exotic Weapon or weapon from the chosen group. This bonus stacks with the bonus granted by the Weapon Focus feat. You may select this Talent multiple times. Each time you select this Talent, it applies to a different Exotic Weapon or weapon group.","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","tree":"Weapon Master","treeId":"2f720d8b061f9bd0","tags":["feat-chain","leader","scaling","soldier","striker","talent-chain"]},"effects":[{"_id":"a0fba2f5-3da6-476e-9ac5-900be2d16e6b","name":"Penetrating Attack","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.combat.weaponGroupDRReduction","mode":2,"value":"5"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Penetrating Attack","effectType":"dr_reduction","weaponGroupSpecific":true,"notes":"Weapon group specific - applies when using designated weapon group"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.penetrating_attack"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.7d547902b8d9109e"}}},{"_id":"13ddb5fb8de8130c","name":"Unarmed","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"1d4+4","damageType":"kinetic","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":1,"cost":0,"equipped":true,"description":"","properties":[],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"simple","proficiency":"simple","subcategory":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"placeholder":true,"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":5,"flatDamageFormula":"1d4+4","useFlat":true}}}},{"_id":"a6b2bf7815773e4c","name":"Blaster Pistol","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"3d6+2","damageType":"energy","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"dex","range":"ranged","weight":1,"cost":500,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>The standard sidearm used throughout the galaxy. Reliable, common, and effective at close to medi