inder , Comlink (Encrypted, Short-Range), Datapad , Holster (Concealed), Small Fleet of Pirate Ships</p>\n<p><strong>Senses:</strong> Perception +21</p>\n<p><strong>Attack Options:</strong> Coordinated Attack, Double Attack (Pistols), Point-Blank Shot</p>\n<p><strong>Special Actions:</strong> Assault Tactics, Born Leader, Demand Surrender, Deployment Tactics, Inspire Fear III, Outmaneuver, Presence</p>","derived":{},"npcProfile":{"kind":"heroic","mode":"play","sourceAuthority":"statblock","legalProfile":"heroic","legalState":"unchecked","importMode":"play","playReady":true,"statblockAuthority":true,"sourcePack":"heroic","normalizationVersion":1,"authority":{"hp":"statblock","defenses":"statblock","bab":"statblock","attacks":"statblock","skills":"statblock","damageThreshold":"statblock"}}},"items":[{"_id":"298b34eef7f1d7ce","name":"Neimoidian","type":"species","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"size":"medium","speed":6,"abilities":{},"skillBonuses":{},"special":"","languages":[],"source":"","description":"","tags":[]},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"placeholder":true,"unresolved":"Neimoidian"}}},{"_id":"d1e94d6f48faca74","name":"Coordinated Attack","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"When you and an ally both attack the same target in the same round, you each gain a +1 bonus to attack rolls against that target.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":85,"tags":["noble","non-force","soldier","striker","support","sustained-damage"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Noble"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Automatic success with <a href=\"/wiki/Aid_Another\" title=\"Aid Another\">Aid Another</a> action at Point-Blank <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Range\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"bab","min":2}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[{"