ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.2d680cc46a7972da"}}},{"_id":"97e254e257159aef","name":"Acute Senses","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Master Scout","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Keen Shot You are skilled at fighting armored characters, taking advantage of their weaknesses. You can use each of the following Actions once per encounter: Binding Hit: You dislodge an enemy's Armor, causing it to hinder the wearer's defenses. Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If you hit and damage your target, the target loses its Armor bonus to its Reflex Defense and is Flat-Footed. This effect remains until the target spends a Standard Action to adjust its Armor. Blinding Fire: Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If the attack hits and damages the target, the target takes a -2 penalty to all attacks until the end of your next turn. Additionally, all other creatures, Droids, and Vehicles have Concealment from the target until the end of your next turn. Slowing Shot: Your hit damages your target's Armor so that the target's movement is hindered. Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If you hit and damage the target, the target's Speed is reduced by two squares until the end of your next turn.","description":"Keen Shot You are skilled at fighting armored characters, taking advantage of their weaknesses. You can use each of the following Actions once per encounter: Binding Hit: You dislodge an enemy's Armor, causing it to hinder the wearer's defenses. Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If you hit and damage your target, the target loses its Armor bonus to its Reflex Defense and is Flat-Footed. This effect remains until the target spends a Standard Action to adjust its Armor. Blinding Fire: Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If the attack hits and damages the target, the target takes a -2 penalty to all attacks until the end of your next turn. Additionally, all other creatures, Droids, and Vehicles have Concealment from the target until the end of your next turn. Slowing Shot: Your hit damages your target's Armor so that the target's movement is hindered. Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If you hit and damage the target, the target's Speed is reduced by two squares until the end of your next turn.","class":"Scout","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scout","tree":"Master Scout","treeId":"dca33c0215264a02","tags":["action-economy","armor","controller","damage-reduction","defender","force","force-control","force-defense","force-offense","melee","mobility","positioning","ranged","scout","striker","support"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.acute_senses"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.f0166d26d9f6252a"}}},{"_id":"3e2f5ae60b22c8b4","name":"Demolitionist 1","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","system":{"tree":"Unknown","prerequisite":"","benefit":"","special":"","uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perEncounter":false,"perDay":false}},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"placeholder":true,"unresolved":"Demolitionist 1"}}},{"_id":"2a1f821e479d6e74","name":"Disruptive","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Misfortune","prerequisites":"","benefit":"As a Standard Action, you can do or say something that catches your enemies off guard. All opponents within 6 squares of you, and within your line of sight take a -2 penalty to their Defenses until the start of your next turn. The penalty is negated if line of sight is broken. This Talent has a range of 6 squares at Starship Scale. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War Prerequisites: , Walk the Line You can create opportunities to chip away at our opponents' defenses. You can use each of the following actions once per encounter as a Standard Action: Create Opening: Make a single melee or ranged attack against any target within your Range. If you damage the target, the target takes a -5 penalty to their Reflex Defense until the start of your next turn. Crippling Attack: Make a single melee or ranged attack against any target within your Range. Until the start of your next turn, the target takes a -2 penalty to their base speed. Vicious Attack: Make a melee or ranged attack within your Range against two opponents that are within 2 squares of each other. Make separate attack rolls at a -5 penalty against each target, but roll damage once only. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy You can fill your opponent with doubt by making a Persuasion check as a Standard Action against a single target that can hear and understand you within 12 squares of you. If your check result equals or exceeds the target's Will Defense, the target takes a -2 penalty to its base speed, and if the target takes a Standard Action, it must also spend its Swift Action. This penalty lasts until the end of the target's next turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy","description":"As a Standard Action, you can do or say something that catches your enemies off guard. All opponents within 6 squares of you, and within your line of sight take a -2 penalty to their Defenses until the start of your next turn. The penalty is negated if line of sight is broken. This Talent has a range of 6 squares at Starship Scale. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War Prerequisites: , Walk the Line You can create opportunities to chip away at our opponents' defenses. You can use each of the following actions once per encounter as a Standard Action: Create Opening: Make a single melee or ranged attack against any target within your Range. If you damage the target, the target takes a -5 penalty to their Reflex Defense until the start of your next turn. Crippling Attack: Make a single melee or ranged attack against any target within your Range. Until the start of your next turn, the target takes a -2 penalty to their base speed. Vicious Attack: Make a melee or ranged attack within your Range against two opponents that are within 2 squares of each other. Make separate attack rolls at a -5 penalty against each target, but roll damage once only. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy You can fill your opponent with doubt by making a Persuasion check as a Standard Action against a single target that can hear and understand you within 12 squares of you. If your check result equals or exceeds the target's Will Defense, the target takes a -2 penalty to its base speed, and if the target takes a Standard Action, it must also spend its Swift Action. This penalty lasts until the end of the target's next turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy","class":"Scoundrel","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scoundrel","tree":"Misfortune","treeId":"67b59e020c1660eb","tags":["action-economy","defender","melee","mobility","positioning","ranged","scaling","scoundrel","skills","social","striker"]},"effects":[{"_id":"4eefbe8a-47cc-4cee-a02a-7c11b76bd6b5","name":"Disruptive","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.morale.bonuses_suppressed","mode":5,"value":"true"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Disruptive"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.disruptive"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.91b335f8565b90ef"}}},{"_id":"df7e91194c948bd1","name":"Keen Shot","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Awareness","prerequisites":"Acute Senses","benefit":"Ignore penalties against opponents with concealment (except total concealment).","description":"Ignore concealment penalties except total concealment.","class":"Scout","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scout","tree":"Awareness","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","id":"swse.talent.acute_senses"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"1c48d1cd9ab1f5c8","tags":["feat-chain","ranged","scout","talent-chain"]},"effects":[{"_id":"ef19c1fd-23a5-4d9c-9a58-fbe2725f4f2c","name":"Keen Shot","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.ranged.concealmentPenalty","mode":5,"value":"0"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Keen Shot","effectType":"concealment_penalty"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.keen_shot"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.aca0598e9b0eb935"}}},{"_id":"8a65c864e658120d","name":"Melee Smash","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Melee Specialist","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Unrelenting Assault You twirl your Weapon around you in a blur, creating a circle of death around you. Any enemy target that begins its turn adjacent to you takes damage equal to your Strength bonus. You must be wielding a Melee Weapon to be using this Talent.","description":"Unrelenting Assault You twirl your Weapon around you in a blur, creating a circle of death around you. Any enemy target that begins its turn adjacent to you takes damage equal to your Strength bonus. You must be wielding a Melee Weapon to be using this Talent.","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","tree":"Melee Specialist","treeId":"fad8118981c532f0","tags":["melee","positioning","soldier","striker","sustained-damage"]},"effects":[{"_id":"2d692811-5c22-48b8-944d-45db89ca5e77","name":"Melee Smash","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.damage.melee","mode":5,"value":"half_level"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Melee Smash"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.melee_smash"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.e0ee525f4109cfde"}}},{"_id":"33544067c9203b9a","name":"Notorious","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Bounty Hunter","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Your skill as a bounty hunter is known throughout the galaxy, even on fringe worlds. When you are not disguised, you may reroll any Persuasion checks made to intimidate others, keeping the better result.","description":"Your skill as a bounty hunter is known throughout the galaxy, even on fringe worlds. When you are not disguised, you may reroll any Persuasion checks made to intimidate others, keeping the better result.","class":"Bounty Hunter","costNumeric":null,"category":"Bounty Hunter","tree":"Bounty Hunter","treeId":"a47ed82a822e3962","tags":["leader","scoundrel","skills","social","striker","support"],"summary":"When not disguised, reroll Persuasion checks to intimidate and keep the better result.","source":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":209},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.c67cbd59abd1cc53"}}},{"_id":"f91167d8bad10e30","name":"Stunning Strike 2","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","system":{"tree":"Unknown","prerequisite":"","benefit":"","special":"","uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perEncounter":false,"perDay":false}},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"placeholder":true,"unresolved":"Stunning Strike 2"}}},{"_id":"26c332ea4ef79d6f","name":"Vibroblade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"2d6+10","damageType":"kinetic","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":2,"cost":500,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>A blade weapon enhanced with ultrasonic vibrations that increase its cutting power.</p>\n      <p><strong>Special:</strong> Vibroweapon. Critical threat range 19-20.</p>","properties":["Vibroweapon","Critical 19-20"],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"melee","proficiency":"advanced-melee","subcategory":"advanced","costNumeric":500,"category":"advanced"},"e