 take the -5 penalty when using them.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["noble","non-force","scoundrel","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout","Scoundrel","Noble"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{}},"effects":[{"_id":"220daaa7-e1b5-440d-98cd-10f5e586ef8b","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.2d680cc46a7972da"}}},{"_id":"c98832766aae5686","name":"Force Power Mastery","type":"feat","img":"systems/foundryvtt-swse/assets/icons/force-technique.png","system":{"featType":"force","benefit":"Choose a single Force Power. You may Take 10 on Use the Force checks to activate this Force Power even when distracted or threatened.","prerequisite":"","special":"You may select this Force Technique multiple times; each time you select this Force Technique, it applies to a different Force Power.","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Core","page":0,"tags":["force-technique"],"bonus_feat_for":[],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"description":"<p>Choose a single Force Power. You may Take 10 on Use the Force checks to activate this Force Power even when distracted or threatened.</p><p><strong>Special:</strong> You may select this Force Technique multiple times; each time you select this Force Technique, it applies to a different Force Power.</p>","relatedPower":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcetechniques.07cea7e3e8b21d69"}}},{"_id":"b785d139751ebaba","name":"Improved Move Light Object","type":"feat","img":"systems/foundryvtt-swse/assets/icons/force-technique.png","system":{"featType":"force","benefit":"You may make a Use the Force check to Move Light Object as a Swift Action instead of a Move Action. Using the light object as a projectile weapon requires a Move Action (instead of a Standard Action).","prerequisite":"Move Light Object","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Core","page":0,"tags":["force-technique"],"bonus_feat_for":[],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"description":"<p>You may make a Use the Force check to Move Light Object as a Swift Action instead of a Move Action. Using the light object as a projectile weapon requires a Move Action (instead of a Standard Action).</p><p><strong>Related Power:</strong> Move Light Object</p><p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Move Light Object</p>","relatedPower":"Move Light Object"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcetechniques.c406600924a7780e"}}},{"_id":"fa3c0e7262cf4165","name":"Improved Sense Force","type":"feat","img":"systems/foundryvtt-swse/assets/icons/force-technique.png","system":{"featType":"force","benefit":"You may use the Sense Force ability of the Use the Force Skill as a Move Action rather than a Full-Round Action.","prerequisite":"Sense Force","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Core","page":0,"tags":["force-technique"],"bonus_feat_for":[],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"description":"<p>You may use the Sense Force ability of the Use the Force Skill as a Move Action rather than a Full-Round Action.</p><p><strong>Related Power:</strong> Sense Force</p><p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Sense Force</p>","relatedPower":"Sense Force"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcetechniques.ad67b8f3959860f2"}}},{"_id":"4a4c00a07fdfa18c","name":"Improved Sense Surroundings","type":"feat","img":"systems/foundryvtt-swse/assets/icons/force-technique.png","system":{"featType":"force","benefit":"You may use the Sense Surroundings application of the Use the Force Skill as a Free Action rather than a Swift Action.","prerequisite":"Sense Surroundings","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Core","page":0,"tags":["force-technique"],"bonus_feat_for":[],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"description":"<p>You may use the Sense Surroundings application of the Use the Force Skill as a Free Action rather than a Swift Action.</p><p><strong>Related Power:</strong> Sense Surroundings</p><p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Sense Surroundings</p>","relatedPower":"Sense Surroundings"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcetechniques.4955b5076ca5da89"}}},{"_id":"840baa6f304c951e","name":"Armor Mastery","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Armor Specialist","prerequisites":"Armored Defense","benefit":"Increase the maximum Dexterity bonus you can apply while wearing armor by +1.","description":"Your Reflex Defense bonus equals heroic level plus half armor bonus or armor bonus; counts as Armored and Improved Armored Defense.","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","tree":"Armor Specialist","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","id":"swse.talent.armored_defense"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"17cec542331cb4e4","tags":["armor","defender","feat-chain","soldier","striker","talent-chain"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.armor_mastery"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.4fc3fe4c1e7f9ba0"}}},{"_id":"464568f1cb13a1af","name":"Block","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Sith Alchemy","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Create Sith Amulet: You can create a Sith Amulet. The creation of a Sith Amulet requires 25,000 credits' worth of gems and other raw materials, and the creation process takes 1 week (this work can be spread out over several sessions and need not be consecutive). At the end of the process, you must spend a Force Point to complete the Sith Amulet, after which point it functions exactly as a Sith Amulet. Create Sith Armor: You can transform a suit of normal Battle Armor into the Dark Armor worn by Sith Lords. You must have a suit of Battle Armor to transform into the Dark Armor (Light Battle Armor becomes Light Dark Armor, Battle Armor becomes Dark Armor, and Heavy Battle Armor becomes Heavy Dark Armor). The transformation process takes 1 day for Light Dark Armor, 2 days for Dark Armor, and 3 days for Heavy Dark Armor. You must spend a Force Point at the end of the creation process to complete the Armor's transformation. Create Sith Talisman: You can spend a Force Point to imbue a portable object with the Dark Side, creating a Sith Talisman that provides offensive strength to a Force Power. Creating the Sith Talisman takes a Full-Round Action. While you wear or carry the Sith Talisman on your person, you add 1d6 to your damage with Force Powers. You increase your Dark Side Score by 1 when you first wear or carry a Sith Talisman. You can have only one Sith Talisman active at any given time, and if it is destroyed, you cannot create another one for 24 hours. Create Sith Weapon: You can alchemically treat a Simple Weapon (Melee) or an Advanced Melee Weapon, turning it into a Sith Weapon. You must spend a Force Point and spend 1 hour imbuing the Weapon with the properties of a Sith Alchemical Weapon (see also: Sith Alchemical Weapon Template). A Lightsaber does not ignore the Sith Weapon's DR, and characters who are proficient in the Weapon's use can treat it as a Lightsaber for the purposes of the , Deflect, and Redirect Shot Talents (and any Talents that have these Talents as a prerequisite). Additionally, as a Swift Action, the wielder of a Sith Weapon can spend a Force Point to gain a bonus equal to their Dark Side Score to the damage of their next attack made with the Weapon before the end of the encounter. This increases the wielder's Dark Side Score by 1.","description":"Create Sith Amulet: You can create a Sith Amulet. The creation of a Sith Amulet requires 25,000 credits' worth of gems and other raw materials, and the creation process takes 1 week (this work can be spread out over several sessions and need not be consecutive). At the end of the process, you must spend a Force Point to complete the Sith Amulet, after which point it functions exactly as a Sith Amulet. Create Sith Armor: You can transform a suit of normal Battle Armor into the Dark Armor worn by Sith Lords. You must have a suit of Battle Armor to transform into the Dark Armor (Light Battle Armor becomes Light Dark Armor, Battle Armor becomes Dark Armor, and Heavy Battle Armor becomes Heavy Dark Armor). The transformation process takes 1 day for Light Dark Armor, 2 days for Dark Armor, and 3 days for Heavy Dark Armor. You must spend a Force Point at the end of the creation process to complete the Armor's transformation. Create Sith Talisman: You can spend a Force Point to imbue a portable object with the Dark Side, creating a Sith Talisman that provides offensive strength to a Force Power. Creating the Sith Talisman takes a Full-Round Action. While you wear or carry the Sith Talisman on your person, you add 1d6 to your damage with Force Powers. You increase your Dark Side Score by 1 when you first wear or carry a Sith Talisman. You can have only one Sith Talisman active at any given time, and if it is destroyed, you cannot create another one for 24 hours. Create Sith Weapon: You can alchemically treat a Simple Weapon (Melee) or an Advanced Melee Weapon, turning it into a Sith Weapon. You must spend a Force Point and spend 1 hour imbuing the Weapon with the properties of a Sith Alchemical Weapon (see also: Sith Alchemical Weapon Template). A Lightsaber does not ignore the Sith Weapon's DR, and characters who are proficient in the Weapon's use can treat it as a Lightsaber for the purposes of the , Deflect, and Redirect Shot Talents (and any Talents that have these Talents as a prerequisite). Additionally, as a Swift Action, the wielder of a Sith Weapon can spend a Force Point to gain a bonus equal to their Dark Side Score to the damage of their next attack made with the Weapon before the end of the encounter. This increases the wielder's Dark Side Score by 1.","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","tree":"Sith Alchemy","treeId":"a67faf2ae089ab5d","tags":["action-economy","armor","dark-side","defender","force","force-offense","jedi","lightsaber","melee","mobility","ranged","striker","support","sustained-damage"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.block"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.9379daa94a228c04"}}},{"_id":"2c32bd83a6ac6f66","name":"Deflect","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Lightsaber Forms","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Redirect Shot","description":"Redirect Shot","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","tree":"Lightsaber Forms","treeId":"2bc2572e852832e4","tags":["jedi","lightsaber","melee","ranged"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.deflect"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.72c644f7a09b1186"}}},{"_id":"bddf3e7c0c849f2f","name":"Force Intuition","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Jedi Guardian","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Prerequisites: The Jedi focuses on those around them, mentally highlighting each opponent. At the beginning of an encounter, you may roll a DC 20 Use the Force check. If successful, you may adjust your Initiative Count by up to +5 or down to -5. Homebrew Reference Book: Legacy of the Force Sourcebook Once per round, you may spend a Force Point to reroll a failed attack roll, but the result of the reroll must be accepted, even if it is worse. Homebrew Reference Book: Dark Forces Campaign Guide","description":"Prerequisites: The Jedi focuses on those around them, mentally highlighting each opponent. At the beginning of an encounter, you may roll a DC 20 Use the Force check. If successful, you may adjust your Initiative Count by up to +5 or down to -5. Homebrew Reference Book: Legacy of the Force Sourcebook Once per round, you may spend a Force Point to reroll a failed attack roll, but the result of the reroll must be accepted, even if it is worse. Homebrew Reference Book: Dark Forces Campaign Guide","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","tree":"Jedi Guardian","treeId":"10c843cef8ce2798","tags":["dark-side","force","force-offense","jedi","light-side","scout","skills","striker","support","sustained-damage"]},"effects":[{"_id":"8af800f1-3dbf-4a6b-8205-9eeb391a5869","name":"Force Intuition","icon":"icons/svg/brain.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.skills.initiative.trained","mode":5,"value":"true","priority":20}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Force Intuition"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.force_intuition"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.00deb8b4cce303b6"}}},{"_id":"4f8033701e289206","name":"Greater Weapon Focus (lightsabers)","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Duelist","prerequisites":"Weapon Focus (lightsabers)","benefit":"Gain an additional +1 attack with lightsabers.","description":"Gain +1 attack with lightsabers.","class":"Jedi Knight","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi Knight","tree":"Duelist","treeId":"b3c5d90b5036f39b","tags":["feat-chain","jedi","lightsaber","melee","striker","talent-chain"]},"effects":[{"_id":"e871f71e-474b-4e58-b378-9ebb4f6702c3","name":"Greater Weapon Focus (lightsabers)","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.attacks.lightsaber","mode":2,"value":"1"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Greater Weapon Focus (lightsabers)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.greater_weapon_focus_lightsabers"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.3038f4c26de19e39"}}},{"_id":"f4c7ab204a5a3482","name":"Juggernaut","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Armor Specialist","prerequisites":"Armored Defense","benefit":"Armor does not reduce speed or distance moved.","description":"Armor does not reduce your speed or distance moved.","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","tree":"Armor Specialist","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","id":"swse.talent.armored_defense"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"17cec542331cb4e4","tags":["armor","controller","damage-reduction","defender","feat-chain","mobility","positioning","soldier","talent-chain"]},"effects":[{"_id":"bbba797f-b820-4645-90ee-c462bc890f35","name":"Juggernaut","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.armor.speedPenalty","mode":5,"value":"0"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Juggernaut","effectType":"armor_speed_penalty"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.juggernaut"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.55f4a04087dacddc"}}},{"_id":"8c86e7f4a6ceaeab","name":"Oath of Duty","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Knight's Resolve","prerequisites":null,"benefit":"When an ally within 12 squares hits with a lightsaber, you gain hit points equal to 3 × class level.","description":"When an ally within 12 squares hits with a lightsaber, gain hit points equal to three times your class level.","class":"Imperial Knight","costNumeric":null,"category":"Imperial Knight","tree":"Knight's Resolve","treeId":"8048efd85ae61101","tags":["lightsaber","melee","positioning","striker","support"]},"effects":[{"_id":"1514641e-7c47-4b9c-9aff-d3020b04ca63","name":"Oath of Duty","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.hp.regen","mode":2,"value":"3_per_level"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Oath of Duty"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.oath_of_duty"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.001ae84d5862af55"}}},{"_id":"df48531e4e6360f0","name":"Redirect Shot","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Lightsaber Forms","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Whenever you redirect a deflected blaster bolt (see the Talent), you gain a +5 bonus on your ranged attack roll.","description":"Whenever you redirect a deflected blaster bolt (see the Talent), you gain a +5 bonus on your ranged attack roll.","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","tree":"Lightsaber Forms","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","id":"swse.talent.deflect"},{"type":"bab","min":5}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"2bc2572e852832e4","tags":["jedi","lightsaber","melee","positioning","ranged","striker"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.redirect_shot"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.941c1dfd00e697da"}}},{"_id":"163aa6d5649f1287","name":"Battle Strike","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":1,"discipline":"telekinetic","useTheForce":15,"time":"Swift Action","range":"Personal","target":"You","duration":"1 round","effect":"<p>You channel the Force to enhance your next melee attack. Your next melee attack this round gains a +1d6 bonus to damage.</p>","special":"<p>This bonus damage is Force damage and bypasses Damage Reduction.</p>","descriptor":["Telekinetic"],"dcChart":[],"maintainable":false,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":94,"tags":["enhancement","damage","melee"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcepowers.f177dc6d65f76de9"}}},{"_id":"a67cd87f934b5493","name":"Force Shield","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/eye.svg","system":{"powerLevel":1,"discipline":"Unknown","useTheForce":"","time":"standard","range":"","target":"","duration":"","effect":"","special":"","descriptor":"","dcChart":"","maintainable":false,"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1,"perDay":true}},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"placeholder":true,"unresolved":"Force Shield"}}},{"_id":"fa8fb794135fce76","name":"Force Slam","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":2,"discipline":"telekinetic","useTheForce":20,"time":"Standard Action","range":"6 squares","target":"One creature or object","duration":"Instantaneous","effect":"<p>You use telekinetic force to violently slam your target against a surface. The target takes 4d6 damage and is knocked prone.</p>","special":"<p>The target must be within 6 squares of a solid surface (wall, floor, ceiling).</p>","descriptor":["Telekinetic"],"dcChart":[],"maintainable":false,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":97,"tags":["attack","damage","telekinetic","prone"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcepowers.462a6c23e00c4dfc"}}},{"_id":"4b933dc1ffbe7a06","name":"Move Object","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":2,"discipline":"telekinetic","useTheForce":15,"time":"Standard Action","range":"12 squares","target":"One object or creature","duration":"Concentration","effect":"<p>You move objects or creatures through the air using telekinesis. The maximum size/weight you can move depends on your Use the Force check result.</p>","special":"<p>Unwilling creatures can make a Will save (DC = your UTF check) to resist being moved.</p>","descriptor":["Telekinetic"],"dcChart":[{"dc":15,"effect":"Medium (50 kg)","description":"Move objects up to Medium size or 50 kg"},{"dc":20,"effect":"Large (250 kg)","description":"Move objects up to Large size or 250 kg"},{"dc":25,"effect":"Huge (1 ton)","description":"Move objects up to Huge size or 1 metric ton"},{"dc":30,"effect":"Gargantuan (5 tons)","description":"Move objects up to Gargantuan size or 5 metric tons"},{"dc":35,"effect":"Colossal (20 tons)","description":"Move objects up to Colossal size or 20 metric tons (starfighter-sized)"}],"maintainable":true,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":98,"tags":["telekinetic","movement","utility"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcepowers.289013a32bd179ad"}}},{"_id":"d3e62d78c179d134","name":"Rebuke","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":2,"discipline":"telepathic","useTheForce":20,"time":"Standard Action","range":"6 squares","target":"One Force-sensitive creature","duration":"1 round","effect":"<p>You overwhelm a Force user with a powerful Force presence. If the target is Force-sensitive, they must make a Will save (DC = your UTF check) or be dazed for 1 round.</p>","special":"<p>This power only affects Force-sensitive creatures.</p>","descriptor":["Mind-Affecting"],"dcChart":[],"maintainable":false,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":99,"tags":["debuff","force-user","daze"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcepowers.390074b44aedfa2a"}}},{"_id":"7ca6af52a6e4862d","name":"Surge","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":1,"discipline":"vital","useTheForce":15,"time":"Swift Action","range":"Personal","target":"You","duration":"1 round","effect":"<p>You use the Force to push your body beyond normal limits. You gain an additional move action this turn.</p>","special":"<p>This extra move action can be used to move or perform other move-action tasks.</p>","descriptor":["Vital"],"dcChart":[],"maintainable":false,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":99,"tags":["enhancement","action-economy","movement"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcepowers.1ac1084ca8f07114"}}},{"_id":"c44f0d7a1fab146f","name":"Lightsaber","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"2d8+13","damageType":"energy","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":1,"cost":12000,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>The elegant weapon of the Jedi and Sith. A blade of pure energy capable of cutting through nearly anything.</p>\n      <p><strong>Special:</strong> Ignores armor bonuses to Reflex Defense. Can deflect blaster bolts. Critical threat range 19-20. Requires exotic weapon proficiency.</p>","properties":["Lightsaber","Critical 19-20","Exotic","Armor-Piercing"],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"melee","proficiency":"exotic","subcategory":"lightsaber","costNumeric":12000,"category":"lightsaber"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.weapons.weapon-lightsaber"},"swse":{"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":21,"flatDamageFormula":"2d8+13","useFlat":true}}}},{"_id":"939094f7762ff0f0","name":"Lightsaber (*)","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"2d8+23","damageType":"energy","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":1,"cost":12000,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>The elegant weapon of the Jedi and Sith. A blade of pure energy capable of cutting through nearly anything.</p>\n      <p><strong>Special:</strong> Ignores armor bonuses to Reflex Defense. Can deflect blaster bolts. Critical threat range 19-20. Requires exotic weapon proficiency.</p>","properties":["Lightsaber","Critical 19-20","Exotic","Armor-Piercing"],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"melee","proficiency":"exotic","subcategory":"lightsaber","costNumeric":12000,"category":"lightsaber"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.weapons.weapon-lightsaber"},"swse":{"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":16,"flatDamageFormula":"2d8+23","useFlat":true}}}},{"_id":"e1d1cf3c89876f1d","name":"Lightsaber (with Rapid Strike)","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"3d8+13","damageType":"energy","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":1,"cost":12000,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>The elegant weapon of the Jedi and Sith. A blade of pure energy capable of cutting through nearly anything.</p>\n      <p><strong>Special:</strong> Ignores armor bonuses to Reflex Defense. Can deflect blaster bolts. Critical threat range 19-20. Requires exotic weapon proficiency.</p>","properties":["Lightsaber","Critical 19-20","Exotic","Armor-Piercing"],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"melee","proficiency":"exotic","subcategory":"lightsaber","costNumeric":12000,"category":"lightsaber"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.weapons.weapon-lightsaber"},"swse":{"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":19,"flatDamageFormula":"3d8+13","useFlat":true}}}},{"_id":"59dc7e05535d7f06","name":"Lightsaber (* with Rapid Strike)","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"3d8+23","damageType":"energy","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":1,"cost":12000,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>The elegant weapon of the Jedi and Sith. A blade of pure energy capable of cutting through nearly anything.</p>\n      <p><strong>Special:</strong> Ignores armor bonuses to Reflex Defense. Can deflect blaster bolts. Critical threat range 19-20. Requires exotic weapon proficiency.</p>","properties":["Lightsaber","Critical 19-20","Exotic","Armor-Piercing"],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"melee","proficiency":"exotic","subcategory":"lightsaber","costNumeric":12000,"category":"lightsaber"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.weapons.weapon-lightsaber"},"swse":{"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":14,"flatDamageFormula":"3d8+23","useFlat":true}}}}],"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"import":{"source":"books","raw":{"Size":"Medium","Species":"Human","Nonheroic Level":0,"Class Levels":{"Jedi":7,"Knight":8},"Destiny Points":1,"Force Points":7,"Dark Side Points":0,"Senses":"Improved Sense Force , Improved Sense Surroundings (Can Sense Surroundings as a Free Action ); Perception : +13","Languages":["Basic"],"Unassigned Languages":0,"Reflex Defense":33,"Flat-Footed Defense":31,"Fortitude Defense":32,"Will Defense":29,"Hit Points":137,"Damage Threshold":32,"Speed":"6 Squares","Melee Weapons":"Lightsaber +21 (2d8+13), Lightsaber +16* (2d8+23), Lightsaber +19 (3d8+13) with Rapid Strike, Lightsaber +14* (3d8+23) with Rapid Strike","Ranged Weapons":"By Weapon +17","Base Attack Bonus":15,"Grapple":18,"Attack Options":["Power Attack","Rapid Strike"],"Special Actions":["Oath of Duty","Redirect Shot"],"Force Powers":["Battle Strike","Force Shield","Force Slam","Move Object","Rebuke","Surge"],"Force Secrets":[],"Force Techniques":["Force Techniques : Force Power Mastery ( Battle Strike )","Improved Move Light Object","Improved Sense Force","Improved Sense Surroundings"],"Strength":16,"Dexterity":14,"Constitution":14,"Intelligence":10,"Wisdom":13,"Charisma":14,"Talents":["Talents : Armor Mastery","Block","Deflect","Force Intuition","Greater Weapon Focus (Lightsabers)","Juggernaut","Oath of Duty","Redirect Shot"],"Feats":["Feats : Armor Proficiency (Light)","Armor Proficiency (Medium)","Force Sensitivity","Force Training (3)","Improved Defenses","Power Attack","Rapid Strike","Skill Focus (Use the Force)","Weapon Focus (Lightsabers)","Weapon Proficiency (Lightsabers)","Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"],"Skills":["Skills : Initiative","Perception","Pilot","Use the Force"],"Trained Skills":["Skills : Initiative","Perception","Pilot","Use the Force"],"Species Traits":[],"Gear":"Imperial Knight Armor (+8 Reflex , +2 Fortitude ), Cortosis Gauntlet , Lightsaber ( Self-Built ), Comlink (Short-Range), Various Personal Belongings"},"mode":"play","sourcePack":"heroic","sourceAuthority":"statblock","playReady":true,"normalizedForPlay":true,"playNormalizationVersion":1}}}}
