,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{}},"effects":[{"_id":"220daaa7-e1b5-440d-98cd-10f5e586ef8b","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.2d680cc46a7972da"}}},{"_id":"370061fd00192804","name":"Improved Sense Surroundings","type":"feat","img":"systems/foundryvtt-swse/assets/icons/force-technique.png","system":{"featType":"force","benefit":"You may use the Sense Surroundings application of the Use the Force Skill as a Free Action rather than a Swift Action.","prerequisite":"Sense Surroundings","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Core","page":0,"tags":["force-technique"],"bonus_feat_for":[],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"description":"<p>You may use the Sense Surroundings application of the Use the Force Skill as a Free Action rather than a Swift Action.</p><p><strong>Related Power:</strong> Sense Surroundings</p><p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Sense Surroundings</p>","relatedPower":"Sense Surroundings"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcetechniques.4955b5076ca5da89"}}},{"_id":"4c6fa63cff966a40","name":"Battle Meditation","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Sense","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Link Using a meditative battle trance, Force-users are able to join their minds together, collectively becoming stronger. However, a masterful degree of will is required to prevent the participants from sharing their weaknesses as well as their strengths. As a Full-Round Action, you can designate a number of willing allies equal to your Charisma modifier within 12 squares of you. These allies must be Trained in the Use the Force skill. As long as you remain within 12 squares of each other, you can Aid Another on attack rolls and Skill Checks as a Reaction.","description":"Link Using a meditative battle trance, Force-users are able to join their minds together, collectively becoming stronger. However, a masterful degree of will is required to prevent the participants from sharing their weaknesses as well as their strengths. As a Full-Round Action, you can designate a number of willing allies equal to your Charisma modifier within 12 squares of you. These allies must be Trained in the Use the Force skill. As long as you remain within 12 squares of each other, you can Aid Another on attack rolls and Skill Checks as a Reaction.","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","tree":"Sense","treeId":"d6b4331c0e31f7e3","tags":["action-economy","force","force-offense","jedi","positioning","striker","sustained-damage"]},"effects":[{"_id":"0cdcb68b-7eeb-45d0-ae5c-575d13648a00","name":"Battle Meditation","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.attacks.allies","mode":2,"value":"1"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Battle Meditation"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.battle_meditation"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.9461c7aa79dd07c6"}}},{"_id":"133c454ac9a5f977","name":"Block","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Sith Alchemy","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Create Sith Amulet: You can create a Sith Amulet. The creation of a Sith Amulet requires 25,000 credits' worth of gems and other raw materials, and the creation process takes 1 week (this work can be spread out over several sessions and need not be consecutive). At the end of the process, you must spend a Force Point to complete the Sith Amulet, after which point it functions exactly as a Sith Amulet. Create Sith Armor: You can transform a suit of normal Battle Armor into the Dark Armor worn by Sith Lords. You must have a suit of Battle Armor to transform into the Dark Armor (Light Battle Armor becomes Light Dark Armor, Battle Armor becomes Dark Armor, and Heavy Battle Armor becomes Heavy Dark Armor). The transformation process takes 1 day for Light Dark Armor, 2 days for Dark Armor, and 3 days for Heavy Dark Armor. You must spend a Force Point at the end of the creation process to complete the Armor's transformation. Create Sith Talisman: You can spend a Force Point to imbue a portable object with the Dark Side, creating a Sith Talisman that provides offensive strength to a Force Power. Creating the Sith Talisman takes a Full-Round Action. While you wear or carry the Sith Talisman on your person, you add 1d6 to your damage with Force Powers. You increase your Dark Side Score by 1 when you first wear or carry a Sith Talisman. You can have only one Sith Talisman active at any given time, and if it is destroyed, you cannot create another one for 24 hours. Create Sith Weapon: You can alchemically treat a Simple Weapon (Melee) or an Advanced Melee Weapon, turning it into a Sith Weapon. You must spend a Force Point and spend 1 hour imbuing the Weapon with the properties of a Sith Alchemical Weapon (see also: Sith Alchemical Weapon Template). A Lightsaber does not ignore the Sith Weapon's DR, and characters who are proficient in the Weapon's use can treat it as a Lightsaber for the purposes of the , Deflect, and Redirect Shot Talents (and any Talents that have these Talents as a prerequisite). Additionally, as a Swift Action, the wielder of a Sith Weapon can spend a Force Point to gain a bonus equal to their Dark Side Score to the damage of their next attack made with the Weapon before the end of the encounter. This increases the wielder's Dark Side Score by 1.","description":"Create Sith Amulet: You can create a Sith Amulet. The creation of a Sith Amulet requires 25,000 credits' worth of gems and other raw materials, and the creation process takes 1 week (this work can be spread out over several sessions and need not be consecutive). At the end of the process, you must spend a Force Point to complete the Sith Amulet, after which point it functions exactly as a Sith Amulet. Create Sith Armor: You can transform a suit of normal Battle Armor into the Dark Armor worn by Sith Lords. You must have a suit of Battle Armor to transform into the Dark Armor (Light Battle Armor becomes Light Dark Armor, Battle Armor becomes Dark Armor, and Heavy Battle Armor becomes Heavy Dark Armor). The transformation process takes 1 day for Light Dark Armor, 2 days for Dark Armor, and 3 days for Heavy Dark Armor. You must spend a Force Point at the end of the creation process to complete the Armor's transformation. Create Sith Talisman: You can spend a Force Point to imbue a portable object with the Dark Side, creating a Sith Talisman that provides offensive strength to a Force Power. Creating the Sith Talisman takes a Full-Round Action. While you wear or carry the Sith Talisman on your person, you add 1d6 to your damage with Force Powers. You increase your Dark Side Score by 1 when you first wear or carry a Sith Talisman. You can have only one Sith Talisman active at any given time, and if it is destroyed, you cannot create another one for 24 hours. Create Sith Weapon: You can alchemically treat a Simple Weapon (Melee) or an Advanced Melee Weapon, turning it into a Sith Weapon. You must spend a Force Point and spend 1 hour imbuing the Weapon with the properties of a Sith Alchemical Weapon (see also: Sith Alchemical Weapon Template). A Lightsaber does not ignore the Sith Weapon's DR, and characters who are proficient in the Weapon's use can treat it as a Lightsaber for the purposes of the , Deflect, and Redirect Shot Talents (and any Talents that have these Talents as a prerequisite). Additionally, as a Swift Action, the wielder of a Sith Weapon can spend a Force Point to gain a bonus equal to their Dark Side Score to the damage of their next attack made with the Weapon before the end of the encounter. This increases the wielder's Dark Side Score by 1.","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","tree":"Sith Alchemy","treeId":"a67faf2ae089ab5d","tags":["action-economy","armor","dark-side","defender","force","force-offense","jedi","lightsaber","melee","mobility","ranged","striker","support","sustained-damage"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.block"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.9379daa94a228c04"}}},{"_id":"4f3debcc1286e284","name":"Deflect","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Lightsaber Forms","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Redirect Shot","description":"Redirect Shot","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","tree":"Lightsaber Forms","treeId":"2bc2572e852832e4","tags":["jedi","lightsaber","melee","ranged"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.deflect"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.72c644f7a09b1186"}}},{"_id":"82483eee2aaf7564","name":"Evasion","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Survivor","prerequisites":null,"benefit":"If hit by an area attack, take half or no damage.","description":"Take half or no damage from area attacks.","class":"Scout","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scout","tree":"Survivor","treeId":"9b06340233eb3cdd","tags":["battlefield-control","evasion","scout","striker"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.evasion"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.5400bc8cb1200624"}}},{"_id":"df2ce515d2f733dd","name":"Jedi Quarry","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Jedi Investigator","prerequisites":null,"benefit":"Gain +2 speed if you end your movement adjacent to your target.","description":"Gain +2 speed if you end your movement adjacent to a target.","class":"Jedi Knight","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi Knight","tree":"Jedi Investigator","treeId":"44554c28675292b6","tags":["controller","force","force-control","jedi","light-side","mobility","positioning","striker"]},"effects":[{"_id":"860c1193-7d99-4897-963c-59f57550c3ab","name":"Jedi Quarry","icon":"icons/svg/running.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.speed","mode":2,"value":"2"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Jedi Quarry"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.jedi_quarry"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.dfb9e58c7bcb095c"}}},{"_id":"3a34b99404f8b1ad","name":"Redirect Shot","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Lightsaber Forms","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Whenever you redirect a deflected blaster bolt (see the Talent), you gain a +5 bonus on your ranged attack roll.","description":"Whenever you redirect a deflected blaster bolt (see the Talent), you gain a +5 bonus on your ranged attack roll.","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","tree":"Lightsaber Forms","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","id":"swse.talent.deflect"},{"type":"bab","min":5}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"2bc2572e852832e4","tags":["jedi","lightsaber","melee","positioning","ranged","striker"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.redirect_shot"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.941c1dfd00e697da"}}},{"_id":"805f325e067c2e8e","name":"Force Light","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/eye.svg","system":{"powerLevel":1,"discipline":"Unknown","useTheForce":"","time":"standard","range":"","target":"","duration":"","effect":"","special":"","descriptor":"","dcChart":"","maintainable":false,"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1,"perDay":true}},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"placeholder":true,"unresolved":"Force Light"}}},{"_id":"2736610ec476e084","name":"Force Slam","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":2,"discipline":"telekinetic","useTheForce":20,"time":"Standard Action","range":"6 squares","target":"One creature or object","duration":"Instantaneous","effect":"<p>You use telekinetic force to violently slam your target against a surface. The target takes 4d6 damage and is knocked prone.</p>","special":"<p>The target must be within 6 squares of a solid surface (wall, floor, ceiling).</p>","descriptor":["Telekinetic"],"dcChart":[],"maintainable":false,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":97,"tags":["attack","damage","telekinetic","prone"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcepowers.462a6c23e00c4dfc"}}},{"_id":"6fa6876063dbb397","name":"Move Object","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":2,"discipline":"telekinetic","useTheForce":15,"time":"Standard Action","range":"12 squares","target":"One object or creature","duration":"Concentration","effect":"<p>You move objects or creatures through the air using telekinesis. The maximum size/weight you can move depends on your Use the Force check result.</p>","special":"<p>Unwilling creatures can make a Will save (DC = your UTF check) to resist being moved.</p>","descriptor":["Telekinetic"],"dcChart":[{"dc":15,"effect":"Medium (50 kg)","description":"Move objects up to Medium size or 50 kg"},{"dc":20,"effect":"Large (250 kg)","description":"Move objects up to Large size or 250 kg"},{"dc":25,"effect":"Huge (1 ton)","description":"Move objects up to Huge size or 1 metric ton"},{"dc":30,"effect":"Gargantuan (5 tons)","description":"Move objects up to Gargantuan size or 5 metric tons"},{"dc":35,"effect":"Colossal (20 tons)","description":"Move objects up to Colossal size or 20 metric tons (starfighter-sized)"}],"maintainable":true,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":98,"tags":["telekinetic","movement","utility"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcepowers.289013a32bd179ad"}}},{"_id":"2b42fd6bd8428923","name":"Rebuke","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":2,"discipline":"telepathic","useTheForce":20,"time":"Standard Action","range":"6 squares","target":"One Force-sensitive creature","duration":"1 round","effect":"<p>You overwhelm a Force user with a powerful Force presence. If the target is Force-sensitive, they must make a Will save (DC = your UTF check) or be dazed for 1 round.</p>","special":"<p>This power only affects Force-sensitive creatures.</p>","descriptor":["Mind-Affecting"],"dcChart":[],"maintainable":false,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":99,"tags":["debuff","force-user","daze"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcepowers.390074b44aedfa2a"}}},{"_id":"4a561025e3417ddb","name":"Sever Force","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":6,"discipline":"dark-side","useTheForce":30,"time":"1 minute","range":"Touch","target":"One Force-sensitive creature","duration":"Permanent","effect":"<p>You permanently sever a Force user's connection to the Force. The target loses all Force abilities permanently.</p>","special":"<p>This is an extremely powerful and cruel Dark Side power. Using it gains you 3 Dark Side Points. The target can make a Will save (DC = your UTF check) to resist. Master-level power.</p>","descriptor":["Dark Side","Force Drain"],"dcChart":[],"maintainable":false,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":99,"tags":["debuff","dark-side","permanent","master"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcepowers.b52769dd11b4e52c"}}},{"_id":"fc277bbbcda56570","name":"Surge","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":1,"discipline":"vital","useTheForce":15,"time":"Swift Action","range":"Personal","target":"You","duration":"1 round","effect":"<p>You use the Force to push your body beyond normal limits. You gain an additional move action this turn.</p>","special":"<p>This extra move action can be used to move or perform other move-action tasks.</p>","descriptor":["Vital"],"dcChart":[],"maintainable":false,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":99,"tags":["enhancement","action-economy","movement"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcepowers.1ac1084ca8f07114"}}},{"_id":"3128b433ef348696","name":"Lightsaber","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"2d8+4","damageType":"energy","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":1,"cost":12000,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>The elegant weapon of the Jedi and Sith. A blade of pure energy capable of cutting through nearly anything.</p>\n      <p><strong>Special:</strong> Ignores armor bonuses to Reflex Defense. Can deflect blaster bolts. Critical threat range 19-20. Requires exotic weapon proficiency.</p>","properties":["Lightsaber","Critical 19-20","Exotic","Armor-Piercing"],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"melee","proficiency":"exotic","subcategory":"lightsaber","costNumeric":12000,"category":"lightsaber"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.weapons.weapon-lightsaber"},"swse":{"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":11,"flatDamageFormula":"2d8+4","useFlat":true}}}}],"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"import":{"source":"books","raw":{"Size":"Medium","Species":"Human","Nonheroic Level":0,"Class Levels":{"Scout":1,"Jedi":7,"Knight":1},"Destiny Points":2,"Force Points":5,"Dark Side Points":0,"Initiative":11,"Senses":"Improved Sense Surroundings , Perception +11","Languages":["Basic"],"Unassigned Languages":0,"Reflex Defense":23,"Flat-Footed Defense":21,"Fortitude Defense":22,"Will Defense":23,"Hit Points":77,"Damage Threshold":22,"Speed":"6 Squares","Melee Weapons":"Lightsaber +11 (2d8+4)","Ranged Weapons":"By Weapon +10","Base Attack Bonus":8,"Grapple":10,"Attack Options":["Weapon Finesse"],"Special Actions":["Battle Meditation","Jedi Quarry","Redirect Shot"],"Force Powers":["Force Light","Force Slam","Move Object","Rebuke","Sever Force","Surge"],"Force Secrets":[],"Force Techniques":["Force Techniques : Improved Sense Surroundings"],"Strength":11,"Dexterity":14,"Constitution":12,"Intelligence":11,"Wisdom":14,"Charisma":16,"Talents":["Talents : Battle Meditation","Block","Deflect","Evasion","Jedi Quarry","Redirect Shot"],"Feats":["Feats : Force Sensitivity","Force Training (2)","Skill Focus (Use the Force)","Skill Training (Use the Force)","Strong in the Force","Weapon Finesse","Weapon Proficiency (Lightsabers)","Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)","Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)","Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"],"Skills":["Skills : Initiative","Mechanics","Perception","Pilot","Stealth","Survival","Use the Force"],"Trained Skills":["Skills : Initiative","Mechanics","Perception","Pilot","Stealth","Survival","Use the Force"],"Species Traits":[],"Gear":"Lightsaber ( Self-Built ), Jedi Robes"},"mode":"play","sourcePack":"heroic","sourceAuthority":"statblock","playReady":true,"normalizedForPlay":true,"playNormalizationVersion":1}}}}
{"_id":"81c87a6fc0172c33","name":"Mandalore the Preserver","type":"npc","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"isDroid":false,"droidDegree":"","attributes":{"str":{"base":16,"racial":0,"enhancement":0,"temp":0},"dex":{"base":14,"racial":0,"enhancement":0,"temp":0},"con":{"base":14,"racial":0,"enhancement":0,"temp":0},"int":{"base":14,"racial":0,"enhancement":0,"temp":0},"wis":{"base":15,"racial":0,"enhancement":0,"temp":0},"cha":{"base":10,"racial":0,"enhancement":0,"temp":0}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"trained":false,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"dex","favorite":false},"climb":{"trained":false,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"str","favorite":false},"deception":{"trained":false,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"cha","favorite":false},"endurance":{"trained":true,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"con","favorite":false},"gatherInformation":{"trained":false,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"cha","favorite":false},"initiative":{"trained":true,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"dex","favorite":false},"jump":{"trained":false,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"str","favorite":false},"knowledgeBureaucracy":{"trained":false,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"int","favorite":false},"knowledgeGalacticLore":{"trained":false,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"int","favorite":false},"knowledgeLifeSciences":{"trained":false,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"int","favorite":false},"knowledgePhysicalSciences":{"trained":false,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"int","favorite":false},"knowledgeSocialSciences":{"trained":false,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"int","favorite":false},"knowledgeTactics":{"trained":true,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"int","favorite":false},"knowledgeTechnology":{"trained":false,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"int","favorite":false},"mechanics":{"trained":true,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"int","favorite":false},"perception":{"trained":true,"focused":false,"miscMod":2,"selectedAbility":"wis","favorite":false},"persuasion":{"trained":false,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"cha","favorite":false},"pilot":{"trained":true,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"dex","favorite":false},"ride":{"trained":false,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"dex","favorite":false},"stealth":{"trained":false,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"dex","favorite":false},"survival":{"trained":false,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"wis","favorite":false},"swim":{"trained":false,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"str","favorite":false},"treatInjury":{"trained":false,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"wis","favorite":false},"useComputer":{"trained":false,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"int","favorite":false},"useTheForce":{"trained":false,"focused":false,"miscMod":0,"selectedAbility":"cha","favorite":false}},"hp":{"value":142,"max":142,"temp":0,"bonus":0},"conditionTrack":{"current":0,"persistent":false,"penalty":0},"level":16,"size":"medium","speed":6,"defenses":{"reflex":{"total":29,"armor":0,"classBonus":0,"misc":{"auto":{},"user":{}},"ability":"dex","source":"level","level":0},"fort":{"total":36,"classBonus":0,"misc":{"auto":{},"user":{}},"ability":"con","level":0},"will":{"total":32,"classBonus":0,"misc":{"auto":{},"user":{}},"ability":"wis","level":0},"flatFooted":{"total":27}},"languages":["Basic","Basiliskan","Mando'a"],"destinyPoints":{"value":2,"max":2},"forcePoints":{"value":6,"max":6,"die":"1d6"},"darkSideScore":4,"damageThreshold":34,"bab":16,"race":"Human","class":"Soldier 7 / Trooper 6 / Officer 3","className":"Soldier 7 / Trooper 6 / Officer 3","biography":"<p><strong>Gear:</strong> Heavy Beskar'gam with Helmet Package (+10 Reflex , +4 Fortitude ; +2 Perception , Low-Light Vision), Blaster Gauntlet (2), Dagger Gauntlet, Light Repeating Blaster , Implants ( Bio-Stabilizer Implant , Cardio Implant , Nerve Reinforcement Implant , Regenerative Implant ), Basilisk War Droid</p>\n<p><strong>Senses:</strong> Low-Light Vision, Perception +17</p>\n<p><strong>Attack Options:</strong> Accelerated Strike, Autofire ( Light Repeating Blaster (Only)), Mandalorian Ferocity (Pistols), Mandalorian Glory, Point-Blank Shot, Precise Shot</p>\n<p><strong>Special Actions:</strong> Battle Analysis, Command Cover (+1), Delay Damage, Deployment Tactics, Field Tactics, Indomitable, Share Talent ( Deployment Tactics )</p>","derived":{},"npcProfile":{"kind":"heroic","mode":"play","sourceAuthority":"statblock","legalProfile":"heroic","legalState":"unchecked","importMode":"play","playReady":true,"statblockAuthority":true,"sourcePack":"heroic","normalizationVersion":1,"authority":{"hp":"statblock","defenses":"statblock","bab":"statblock","attacks":"statblock","skills":"statblock","damageThreshold":"statblock"}}},"items":[{"_id":"393dfbbce2f2275c","name":"Human","type":"species","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"size":"Medium","speed":6,"abilities":"None","skillBonuses":[],"special":["Bonus Feat: Humans gain one bonus feat at 1st level","Bonus Trained Skill: Humans gain one additional trained skill at 1st level"],"languages":["Basic"],"source":"Core","description":"","tags":[],"visionTraits":[],"naturalWeapons":[],"movementTraits":[],"environmentalTraits":[],"combatTraits":{"naturalArmor":0,"weaponProficiencies":[],"otherTraits":[]},"techTraits":[],"forceTraits":[],"socialTraits":[],"bonusFeats":1,"bonusTrainedSkills":1,"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":700,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.species.species-human"}}},{"_id":"9137c99296fcdc05","name":"Accelerated Strike","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide","page":25,"tags":["non-force"],"bonus_feat_for":[],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Once per encounter, make a <a href=\"/wiki/Full_Attack\" title=\"Full Attack\">Full Attack</a> as a <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Standard_Action\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a>."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"bab","min":6}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.167c394e90424916"}}},{"_id":"bd7c39b113e64b6b","name":"Armor Proficiency (light)","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You are proficient with light armor and do not take armor check penalties on attack rolls.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":85,"tags":["armor","defender","non-force","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"No penalty on attacks and no <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Armor_Check_Penalty\" title=\"Armor Check Penalty\">Armor Check Penalty</a> while wearing <a href=\"/wiki/Light_Armor\" title=\"Light Armor\">Light Armor</a>."}},"effects":[{"_id":"9781a3c7-4e7e-4af0-9dcc-cdea0524b414","name":"Armor Proficiency (Light)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.armorProficiency.light","mode":5,"value":"true"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Armor Proficiency (Light)","effectType":"armor_proficiency"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.773ec00effc7e96f"}}},{"_id":"96f72bd38de3488a","name":"Armor Proficiency (medium)","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You are proficient with medium armor and do not take armor check penalties on attack rolls.","prerequisite":"Armor Proficiency (Light)","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":85,"tags":["armor","defender","feat-chain","non-force","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"No penalty on attacks and no <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Armor_Check_Penalty\" title=\"Armor Check Penalty\">Armor Check Penalty</a> while wearing <a href=\"/wiki/Light_Armor\" title=\"Light Armor\">Light Armor</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armor\" title=\"Medium Armor\">Medium Armor</a>."}},"effects":[{"_id":"af0983df-e771-4593-8f88-f0aa43612597","name":"Armor Proficiency (Medium)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.armorProficiency.medium","mode":5,"value":"true"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Armor Proficiency (Medium)","effectType":"armor_proficiency"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.d445051370a88a7f"}}},{"_id":"675495946284a1c7","name":"Armor Proficiency (heavy)","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You are proficient with heavy armor and do not take armor check penalties on attack rolls.","prerequisite":"Armor Proficiency (Medium)","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":85,"tags":["armor","defender","feat-chain","non-force","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"No penalty on attacks and no <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Armor_Check_Penalty\" title=\"Armor Check Penalty\">Armor Check Penalty</a> while wearing <a href=\"/wiki/Light_Armor\" title=\"Light Armor\">Light Armor</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armor\" title=\"Medium Armor\">Medium Armor</a>, or <a href=\"