 , Low-Light Vision), Blaster Pistol , Combat Gloves , Knife , Code Cylinder , Comlink (Short-Range), Datapad</p>\n<p><strong>Senses:</strong> Low-Light Vision, Perception +18</p>\n<p><strong>Attack Options:</strong> Dastardly Strike, Devastating Attack (Simple Weapons), Point-Blank Shot, Precise Shot, Sneak Attack (+2d6)</p>\n<p><strong>Special Actions:</strong> Cybernetic Surgery, Educated, Fool's Luck, Knack, Presence, Surgical Expertise</p>","derived":{},"npcProfile":{"kind":"heroic","mode":"play","sourceAuthority":"statblock","legalProfile":"heroic","legalState":"unchecked","importMode":"play","playReady":true,"statblockAuthority":true,"sourcePack":"heroic","normalizationVersion":1,"authority":{"hp":"statblock","defenses":"statblock","bab":"statblock","attacks":"statblock","skills":"statblock","damageThreshold":"statblock"}}},"items":[{"_id":"866764e61fc320eb","name":"Zeltron","type":"species","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"size":"Medium","speed":6,"abilities":"+2 Cha, -2 Wis","skillBonuses":["+2 Persuasion","+2 Deception"],"special":["Empathy","Pheromones"],"languages":["Zeltron","Basic"],"source":"Legacy","description":"","tags":[],"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":10900,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.species.species-zeltron"}}},{"_id":"077d960d49e7e0d0","name":"Armor Proficiency (light)","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You are proficient with light armor and do not take armor check penalties on attack rolls.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":85,"tags":["armor","defender","non-force","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"No penalty on attacks and no <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Armor_Check_Penalty\" title=\"Armor Check Penalty\">Armor Check Penalty<