"description":{"value":"No -5 penalty for shooting into melee."}},"effects":[{"_id":"77e126ab-16c9-4116-9d67-b5550c007b1b","name":"Precise Shot","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Precise Shot","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Precise Shot"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.c180eee7d3bc29b2"}}},{"_id":"674852569e40eeea","name":"Weapon Focus","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You gain a +1 bonus on attack rolls with the selected weapon group.","prerequisite":"Proficient with selected weapon group","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":88,"tags":["feat-chain","non-force","soldier","striker"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"+1 bonus on attack rolls with chosen weapon."}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.c41814601364b643"}}},{"_id":"12a33c0191514aca","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You are proficient with pistols and do not take the -5 penalty when using them.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["non-force","ranged","scoundrel","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout","Scoundrel"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{}},"effects":[{"_id":"04733e85-193e-4f4b-8792-c359083557d1","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.e5d361d01d1b44e4"}}},{"_id":"0deb9f609a8bc5a0","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You are proficient with simple weapons and do not take the -5 penalty when using them.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["noble","non-force","scoundrel","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout","Scoundrel","Noble"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{}},"effects":[{"_id":"220daaa7-e1b5-440d-98cd-10f5e586ef8b","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.2d680cc46a7972da"}}},{"_id":"5f15b4bfcce4764a","name":"Disruptive","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Misfortune","prerequisites":"","benefit":"As a Standard Action, you can do or say something that catches your enemies off guard. All opponents within 6 squares of you, and within your line of sight take a -2 penalty to their Defenses until the start of your next turn. The penalty is negated if line of sight is broken. This Talent has a range of 6 squares at Starship Scale. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War Prerequisites: , Walk the Line You can create opportunities to chip away at our opponents' defenses. You can use each of the following actions once per encounter as a Standard Action: Create Opening: Make a single melee or ranged attack against any target within your Range. If you damage the target, the target takes a -5 penalty to their Reflex Defense until the start of your next turn. Crippling Attack: Make a single melee or ranged attack against any target within your Range. Until the start of your next turn, the target takes a -2 penalty to their base speed. Vicious Attack: Make a melee or ranged attack within your Range against two opponents that are within 2 squares of each other. Make separate attack rolls at a -5 penalty against each target, but roll damage once only. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy You can fill your opponent with doubt by making a Persuasion check as a Standard Action against a single target that can hear and understand you within 12 squares of you. If your check result equals or exceeds the target's Will Defense, the target takes a -2 penalty to its base speed, and if the target takes a Standard Action, it must also spend its Swift Action. This penalty lasts until the end of the target's next turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy","description":"As a Standard Action, you can do or say something that catches your enemies off guard. All opponents within 6 squares of you, and within your line of sight take a -2 penalty to their Defenses until the start of your next turn. The penalty is negated if line of sight is broken. This Talent has a range of 6 squares at Starship Scale. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War Prerequisites: , Walk the Line You can create opportunities to chip away at our opponents' defenses. You can use each of the following actions once per encounter as a Standard Action: Create Opening: Make a single melee or ranged attack against any target within your Range. If you damage the target, the target takes a -5 penalty to their Reflex Defense until the start of your next turn. Crippling Attack: Make a single melee or ranged attack against any target within your Range. Until the start of your next turn, the target takes a -2 penalty to their base speed. Vicious Attack: Make a melee or ranged attack within your Range against two opponents that are within 2 squares of each other. Make separate attack rolls at a -5 penalty against each target, but roll damage once only. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy You can fill your opponent with doubt by making a Persuasion check as a Standard Action against a single target that can hear and understand you within 12 squares of you. If your check result equals or exceeds the target's Will Defense, the target takes a -2 penalty to its base speed, and if the target takes a Standard Action, it must also spend its Swift Action. This penalty lasts until the end of the target's next turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy","class":"Scoundrel","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scoundrel","tree":"Misfortune","treeId":"67b59e020c1660eb","tags":["action-economy","defender","melee","mobility","positioning","ranged","scaling","scoundrel","skills","social","striker"]},"effects":[{"_id":"4eefbe8a-47cc-4cee-a02a-7c11b76bd6b5","name":"Disruptive","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.morale.bonuses_suppressed","mode":5,"value":"true"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Disruptive"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.disruptive"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.91b335f8565b90ef"}}},{"_id":"aa4b80c48b740ef2","name":"Inspire Confidence","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Inspiration","prerequisites":"","benefit":"You can't in yourself. As a Swift Action, you can encourage one of your allies within line of sight to make haste with a Skill Check. On that ally's next turn, that ally can make a Skill Check that normally requires a Standard Action, as a Move Action instead. Prerequisite: You can share your strength of will with your allies. Once per encounter as a Swift Action, you can grant all allies within line of sight a +2 morale bonus to their Will Defense. This bonus lasts for the remainder of the encounter, and once it is granted your allies need not remain within line of sight of you to retain this bonus.","description":"You can't in yourself. As a Swift Action, you can encourage one of your allies within line of sight to make haste with a Skill Check. On that ally's next turn, that ally can make a Skill Check that normally requires a Standard Action, as a Move Action instead. Prerequisite: You can share your strength of will with your allies. Once per encounter as a Swift Action, you can grant all allies within line of sight a +2 morale bonus to their Will Defense. This bonus lasts for the remainder of the encounter, and once it is granted your allies need not remain within line of sight of you to retain this bonus.","class":"Noble","costNumeric":null,"category":"Noble","tree":"Inspiration","treeId":"72d32ebcbb607314","tags":["action-economy","controller","defender","leader","mobility","noble","striker","support"]},"effects":[{"_id":"1faa089c-9609-46d8-8543-9a68ace3553b","name":"Inspire Confidence","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.attacks","mode":2,"value":"1"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Inspire Confidence"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.inspire_confidence"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.4d8882a28da30454"}}},{"_id":"eef3dc88bda53b54","name":"Unarmed","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"1d4+1","damageType":"kinetic","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":1,"cost":0,"equipped":true,"description":"","properties":[],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"simple","proficiency":"simple","subcategory":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"placeholder":true,"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":1,"flatDamageFormula"