anged attack roll against that target, accepting the second result even if it is worse. You and your allies can only gain the benefits of this Talent once per encounter.","class":"Vanguard","costNumeric":null,"category":"Vanguard","tree":"Vanguard","treeId":"ca304c9496f38747","tags":["positioning","ranged","support"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.enhanced_vision"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.d6f62f5d8b003e14"}}},{"_id":"623b09943930c8a1","name":"Slip By","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Opportunist","prerequisites":null,"benefit":"When you damage an opponent, you may move through that opponent’s square; attacks of opportunity apply as normal.","description":"When you damage an opponent, you may move through their square.","class":"Scoundrel","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scoundrel","tree":"Opportunist","treeId":"bf3b07c1687a3ca2","tags":["controller","mobility","positioning","scoundrel","striker"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.slip_by"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.893c4fd12df55469"}}},{"_id":"bd4b0fe0c274705a","name":"Triangulate","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Vanguard","prerequisites":"Enhanced Vision","benefit":"Once per encounter, if you and allies have line of sight to the same target, you may reroll one ranged attack (each affected ally rerolls one attack).","description":"Once per encounter, if you and allies have line of sight to the same target, all may reroll one ranged attack.","class":"Vanguard","costNumeric":null,"category":"Vanguard","tree":"Vanguard","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","id":"swse.talent.enhanced_vision"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"ca304c9496f38747","tags":["feat-chain","positioning","ranged","support","talent-chain"]},"effe