rs , Singularity ( Imperial I -Class Star Destroyer )</p>\n<p><strong>Senses:</strong> Improved Sense Force , Perception +17</p>\n<p><strong>Attack Options:</strong> Dark Scourge, Melee Defense, Power of the Dark Side</p>\n<p><strong>Special Actions:</strong> Cause Mutation, Connections, Dark Presence, Drain Knowledge, Sith Alchemy, Sith Alchemy Specialist, Visions</p>","derived":{},"npcProfile":{"kind":"heroic","mode":"play","sourceAuthority":"statblock","legalProfile":"heroic","legalState":"unchecked","importMode":"play","playReady":true,"statblockAuthority":true,"sourcePack":"heroic","normalizationVersion":1,"authority":{"hp":"statblock","defenses":"statblock","bab":"statblock","attacks":"statblock","skills":"statblock","damageThreshold":"statblock"}}},"items":[{"_id":"aeeae1fed2ea4167","name":"Sorcerer","type":"species","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"size":"medium","speed":6,"abilities":{},"skillBonuses":{},"special":"","languages":[],"source":"","description":"","tags":[]},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"placeholder":true,"unresolved":"Sorcerer"}}},{"_id":"784f3fa85302c692","name":"Force Sensitivity","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"force","benefit":"You can make Use the Force checks and gain access to Force Talents.","prerequisite":"Non-Droid","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":86,"tags":["feat-chain","force"],"bonus_feat_for":[],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"You can make <a href=\"/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> checks and gain access to <a href=\"/wiki/Force_Talents\" title=\"Force Talents\">Force Talents</a>."}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.ddbeb23013d9e917"}}},{"_id":"2bc64f7eafed31a9","name":"Force Training","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"force","benefit":"You learn a number of Force powers equal to 1 + your Wisdom modifier.","prerequisite":"Force Sensitivity, Trained in Use the Force","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":94,"tags":["feat-chain","force","jedi","striker"],"bonus_feat_for":["Jedi"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"forcePowerGrants":1,"description":{"value":"Learn a number of <a href=\"/wiki/Force_Powers\" title=\"Force Powers\">Force Powers</a> equal to 1 + your <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> modifier (minimum 1)."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"skillTrained","skill":"usetheforce"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[{"_id":"d1c60a9b-78e6-4601-85a4-320794fa5a91","name":"Force Training","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Force Training","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Force Training"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.9b7b869a86f39190"}}},{"_id":"f0b36e6ec7e9efec","name":"Linguist","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You gain a number of additional Languages equal to 1 + your Intelligence modifier (Minimum 1). If your Intelligence modifier increases so does the number of languages granted by this Feat.","prerequisite":"Int 13","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["feat-chain","leader","noble","non-force","striker"],"bonus_feat_for":["Noble"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Gain bonus <a href=\"/wiki/Languages\" title=\"Languages\">Languages</a> equal to 1 + your <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> modifier (minimum 1)."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"attribute","ability":"int","m