ct Move Object as one of your Force Powers, you can also select one extra Force Power to add to your Force Power Suite for free. This extra Force Power must contain the [Telekinetic] descriptor. You can only gain one extra Force Power each time you take the Force Training Feat, regardless of how many times you choose the Move Object Force Power. If you increase your Wisdom score at a later time and select the Move Object power, you only gain an additional power if you did not take the Move Object power when you first chose that Feat. Otherwise, you gain an additional Force Power as normal. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide","description":"When you take the Force Training Feat and select Move Object as one of your Force Powers, you can also select one extra Force Power to add to your Force Power Suite for free. This extra Force Power must contain the [Telekinetic] descriptor. You can only gain one extra Force Power each time you take the Force Training Feat, regardless of how many times you choose the Move Object Force Power. If you increase your Wisdom score at a later time and select the Move Object power, you only gain an additional power if you did not take the Move Object power when you first chose that Feat. Otherwise, you gain an additional Force Power as normal. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide","costNumeric":null,"tree":"Alter","treeId":"6ac3416fb6aada56","tags":["controller","force","force-control","mobility"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.telekinetic_savant"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.ddacb8e4517da6b5"}}},{"_id":"2de9cc0d25295a09","name":"Force Thrust","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":2,"discipline":"telekinetic","useTheForce":20,"time":"Standard Action","range":"6 squares","target":"One creature or object","duration":"Instantaneous","effect":"<p>You violently push your target away with telekinetic force. The target is pushed 6 squares away from you and knocked prone, taking 2d6 damage.</p>","special":"<p>If the target hits an obstacle during the push, they take an additional 1d6 damage per 2 squares not traveled.</p>","descriptor":["Telekinetic"],"dcChart":[],"maintainable":false,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":97,"tags":["attack","movement","telekinetic","forced-movement"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcepowers.d51bf85903366b6b"}}},{"_id":"5bee1b409c2cbe2d","name":"Mind Trick","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":1,"discipline":"telepathic","useTheForce":15,"time":"Standard Action","range":"6 squares","target":"One creature","duration":"1 minute or until completed","effect":"<p>You influence a weak mind to believe what you tell them or follow a simple suggestion. The target must make a Will save (DC = your UTF check) or be affected.</p>","special":"<p>The suggestion must be reasonable and the target must be able to understand you.</p>","descriptor":["Mind-Affecting"],"dcChart":[],"maintainable":false,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":98,"tags":["mind-control","suggestion","social"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcepowers.e6649f366d6c5737"}}},{"_id":"2c379fabdacb3448","name":"Move Object","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":2,"discipline":"telekinetic","useTheForce":15,"time":"Standard Action","range":"12 squares","target":"One object or creature","duration":"Concentration","effect":"<p>You move objects or creatures through the air using telekinesis. The maximum size/weight you can move depends on your Use the Force check result.</p>","special":"<p>Unwilling creatures can make a Will save (DC = your UTF check) to resist being moved.</p>","descriptor":["Telekinetic"],"dcChart":[{"dc":15,"effect":"Medium (50 kg)","description":"Move objects up to Medium size or 50 kg"},{"dc":20,"effect":"Large (250 kg)","description":"Move objects up to Large size or 250 kg"},{"dc":25,"effect":"Huge (1 ton)","description":"Move objects up to Huge size or 1 metric ton"},{"dc":30,"effect":"Gargantuan (5 tons)","description":"Move objects up to Gargantuan size or 5 metric tons"},{"dc":35,"effect":"Colossal (20 tons)","description":"Move objects up to Colossal size or 20 metric tons (starfighter-sized)"}],"maintainable":true,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":98,"tags":["telekinetic","movement","utility"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcepowers.289013a32bd179ad"}}},{"_id":"1e39c69767868b12","name":"Knife","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"1d4-1","damageType":"kinetic","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":1,"cost":0,"equipped":true,"description":"","properties":[],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"simple","proficiency":"simple","subcategory":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"placeholder":true,"unresolved":"Knife","npc":{"flatAttackBonus":1,"flatDamageFormula":"1d4-1","useFlat":true}}}},{"_id":"c5258b3dea1b817c","name":"Knife","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"1d4-1","damageType":"kinetic","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"dex","range":"ranged","weight":1,"cost":0,"equipped":true,"description":"","properties":[],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"simple","proficiency":"simple","subcategory":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"placeholder":true,