hen making a ranged attack against an adjacent target or a target in your <a href=\"/wiki/Fighting_Space\" title=\"Fighting Space\">Fighting Space</a>."}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.0dbd1d12c0b99725"}}},{"_id":"6df6154c60dc8395","name":"Defensive Protection","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Versatility","prerequisites":null,"benefit":"Add a Force Point result to any one of your defenses or to one adjacent ally until your next turn.","description":"Add the result of a Force Point to a defense for you or an adjacent ally.","class":"Scout","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scout","tree":"Versatility","treeId":"ab2c265c4b2f54f6","tags":["defender","force","force-defense","positioning","scout","support"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.defensive_protection"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.ded0046215380b0c"}}},{"_id":"9652f2188b55a5f3","name":"Evasion","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Survivor","prerequisites":null,"benefit":"If hit by an area attack, take half or no damage.","description":"Take half or no damage from area attacks.","class":"Scout","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scout","tree":"Survivor","treeId":"9b06340233eb3cdd","tags":["battlefield-control","evasion","scout","striker"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.evasion"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.5400bc8cb1200624"}}},{"_id":"1ca38ce3af336105","name":"Improved Stealth","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Camouflage","prerequisites":"","benefit":"You're very good at hiding when mobile. You take no penalty on your Stealth check when moving your normal Speed. This Talent applies to Stealth checks made while Piloting a Starship (see Starship Stealth). You may choose to reroll any Stealth check, but the result of the reroll must be accepted, even if it is worse. This Talent applies to Stealth checks made while Piloting a Starship (see Starship Stealth). Prerequisite: During a Surprise Round, if you make a ranged attack against a target that is Surprised, you can Aim at the target as a Free Action. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War If you start your turn with Total Concealment or Total Cover from a target, during that turn you can make a Stealth check as a Swift Action, opposed by the target's Perception check. If you succeed, the target is considered Flat-Footed against you until the end of your turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy","description":"You're very good at hiding when mobile. You take no penalty on your Stealth check when moving your normal Speed. This Talent applies to Stealth checks made while Piloting a Starship (see Starship Stealth). You may choose to reroll any Stealth check, but the result of the reroll must be accepted, even if it is worse. This Talent applies to Stealth checks made while Piloting a Starship (see Starship Stealth). Prerequisite: During a Surprise Round, if you make a ranged attack against a target that is Surprised, you can Aim at the target as a Free Action. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War If you start your turn with Total Concealment or Total Cover from a target, during that turn you can make a Stealth check as a Swift Action, opposed by the target's Perception check. If you succeed, the target is considered Flat-Footed against you until the end of your turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy","class":"Scout","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scout","tree":"Camouflage","treeId":"3926d582d2077489","tags":["action-economy","ambush","controller","mobility","perception","piloting","positioning","ranged","scout","skills","stealth","sustained-damage"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.improved_stealth"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.073115894cad8cf9"}}},{"_id":"186b4e289ec569dd","name":"Keep Together","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","system":{"tree":"Unknown","prerequisite":"","benefit":"","special":"","uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perEncounter":false,"perDay":false}},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"placeholder":true,"unresolved":"Keep Together"}}},{"_id":"ce30bd8b8500ba93","name":"Launch Point","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Pathfinder","prerequisites":"Safe Zone","benefit":"Any ally who starts in your Safe Zone and then exits it gains +2 attack.","description":"Allies who start in your safe zone and then leave it gain +2 attack.","class":"Pathfinder","costNumeric":null,"category":"Pathfinder","tree":"Pathfinder","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","id":"swse.talent.safe_zone"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"383ff8d392488cf8","tags":["feat-chain","striker","support","talent-chain"]},"effects":[{"_id":"635fb882-fe55-45a8-a2da-e5fbedf7a644","name":"Launch Point","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.movement.exit_bonus","mode":5,"value":"true"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Launch Point"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.launch_point"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.9aa564522f427214"}}},{"_id":"f9622f21deedebc6","name":"Safe Zone","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Pathfinder","prerequisites":"","benefit":"All enemies treat your as Difficult Terrain. As a Swift Action, you can designate a single ally within your line of sight who has Cover from one or more enemies. That ally is considered instead to have Improved Cover against those enemies until the start of your next turn as long as the ally still has Cover. You can spend a Swift Action to designate one adjacent ally. Until the start of your next turn, if you move, that ally can also move the same number of squares, provided that the ally ends its movement adjacent to you. You cannot move a distance greater than the ally's speed. Prerequisite: Any ally who starts his or her turn within your and then exits the gains a +2 bonus to attack rolls before the end of that ally's turn, provided that the ally is not within your when the attack is made. Prerequisite: Enemies that fire into your take a -2 penalty to attack rolls. Prerequisite: You can dismiss your as a Swift Action, ending its current effects. Any allies in the space your was occupying gain a +2 bonus to their Speed until the start of your next turn. When you use this Talent, you cannot create a new until the start of your next turn. As a Standard Action, you can identify a , within which your allies gain certain advantages. You designate a 4-by-4 square area of the combat area as a ; at least 1 square of the must be the square you currently occupy. Each ally who starts his or her turn within the gains a +2 circumstance bonus to his or her Fortitude Defense and Will Defense until the start of the ally's next turn. The lasts until the end of the encounter, and you can have only one in effect at a time. You can create a new as a Standard Action, dismissing the old and replacing it with the new one, but no square of the old can overlap with any square of the new . You cannot create a in a space that overlaps another Pathfinder's . Prerequisite: Any ally who catches a Second Wind while within your regains a number of additional Hit Points equal to your Class Level.","description":"All enemies treat your as Difficult Terrain. As a Swift Action, you can designate a single ally within your line of sight who has Cover from one or more enemies. That ally is considered instead to have Improved Cover against those enemies until the start of your next turn as long as the ally still has Cover. You can spend a Swift Action to designate one adjacent ally. Until the start of your next turn, if you move, that ally can also move the same number of squares, provided that the ally ends its movement adjacent to you. You cannot move a distance greater than the ally's speed. Prerequisite: Any ally who starts his or her turn within your and then exits the gains a +2 bonus to attack rolls before the end of that ally's turn, provided that the ally is not within your when the attack is made. Prerequisite: Enemies that fire into your take a -2 penalty to attack rolls. Prerequisite: You can dismiss your as a Swift Action, ending its current effects. Any allies in the space your was occupying gain a +2 bonus to their Speed until the start of your next turn. When you use this Talent, you cannot create a new until the start of your next turn. As a Standard Action, you can identify a , within which your allies gain certain advantages. You designate a 4-by-4 square area of the combat area as a ; at least 1 square of the must be the square you currently occupy. Each ally who starts his or her turn within the gains a +2 circumstance bonus to his or her Fortitude Defense and Will Defense until the start of the ally's next turn. The lasts until the end of the encounter, and you can have only one in effect at a time. You can create a new as a Standard Action, dismissing the old and replacing it with the new one, but no square of the old can overlap with any square of the new . You cannot create a in a space that overlaps another Pathfinder's . Prerequisite: Any ally who catches a Second Wind while within your regains a number of additional Hit Points equal to your Class Level.","class":"Pathfinder","costNumeric":null,"category":"Pathfinder","tree":"Pathfinder","treeId":"383ff8d392488cf8","tags":["action-economy","battlefield-control","controller","defender","mobility","positioning","scaling","striker","support"]},"effects":[{"_id":"5