"Commando","prerequisites":null,"benefit":"Once per day, move +5 steps up the condition track (not persistent conditions); may be taken multiple times.","description":"","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","treeId":"798ed0945cbdac1c","tree":"Commando","tags":["condition-removal","controller","mobility","scaling","soldier","striker","sustained-damage"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.indomitable"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.b8aaf500d3069938"}}},{"_id":"6cb7be75e485feff","name":"Lightsaber Defense","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Lightsaber Forms","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Niman When you use the Talent, you gain twice the normal deflection bonus to your Reflex Defense when you are wielding two Lightsabers. Prerequisite: When wielding a single Lightsaber in one hand, the deflection bonus you gain from the Talent increases by 2 (to a maximum of +5). When wielding a Lightsaber, you gain a +1 bonus to your Reflex Defense and Will Defense.","description":"Niman When you use the Talent, you gain twice the normal deflection bonus to your Reflex Defense when you are wielding two Lightsabers. Prerequisite: When wielding a single Lightsaber in one hand, the deflection bonus you gain from the Talent increases by 2 (to a maximum of +5). When wielding a Lightsaber, you gain a +1 bonus to your Reflex Defense and Will Defense.","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","tree":"Lightsaber Forms","treeId":"2bc2572e852832e4","tags":["defender","jedi","lightsaber","melee","striker"]},"effects":[{"_id":"fcdbf882-923a-4095-b0df-a1079c214099","name":"Lightsaber Defense","icon":"icons/svg/shield.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.defenses.reflex.misc","mode":2,"value":"1","priority":20}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Lightsaber Defense"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.lightsaber_defense"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.e8bf1222fd6289e4"}}},{"_id":"9b42b820f23c12da","name":"Modification Specialist","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Autonomy","benefit":"You have become skilled at Reprogramming and modifying your own Droid Systems. You do not incur the normal -5 penalty on Mechanics and Use Computer checks to Reprogram yourself or perform self-modifications.","description":"You have become skilled at Reprogramming and modifying your own Droid Systems. You do not incur the normal -5 penalty on Mechanics and Use Computer checks to Reprogram yourself or perform self-modifications.","prerequisites":[],"class":"Independent Droid","category":"Independent Droid","tree":"Autonomy","treeId":"9fe73a3703fa45fca628fd43cae6bf7f","tags":["feat-chain","mechanics","skills","slicing","striker","talent-chain"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.cc6f40522eca4cdd90dc5a04edad0a07"}}},{"_id":"7db6ef9c4da0b207","name":"Repair Self","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Autonomy","benefit":"When you Repair yourself, you Repair 1 additional Hit Point for each point by which your Mechanics check exceeds the DC.","description":"When you Repair yourself, you Repair 1 additional Hit Point for each point by which your Mechanics check exceeds the DC.","prerequisites":[],"class":"Independent Droid","category":"Independent Droid","tree":"Autonomy","treeId":"9fe73a3703fa45fca628fd43cae6bf7f","tags":["feat-chain","mechanics","skills","striker","talent-chain"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.177198e388ad4e3ca6fe85d3b6b399f5"}}},{"_id":"77df6a656b88ccb7","name":"Targeting Package","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","system":{"tree":"Unknown","prerequisite":"","benefit":"","special":"","uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perEncounter":false,"perDay":false}},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"placeholder":true,"unresolved":"Targeting Package"}}},{"_id":"3b33ec973b16f752","name":"Weapon Specialization (Lightsabers)","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Duelist","tree":"Duelist","prerequisites":"","description":"Greater Weapon Focus (Lightsabers) You gain a +2 bonus on melee damage rolls with Lightsabers. This bonus stacks with the bonus granted by the Talent. Whenever you make multiple attacks with any type of Lightsaber as part of a Full Attack, you reduce the penalty on your attack rolls by 2. You can take this Talent multiple times; each time you take this Talent, you reduce the penalty on your attack rolls by an additional 2. See also: Maiming Foes When you deal damage with a Lightsaber that is equal to or greater than both the target's current Hit Points and the target's Damage Threshold (that is, when you would deal enough damage to kill your target), you may choose to use this Talent. Instead of dealing full damage, you instead deal half damage to your target and move it -1 step on the Condition Track. In addition, you sever one of your target's arms at the wrist or elbow joint, or one of the target's legs at the knee or ankle joint (your choice). Severing part of an arm prevents the target from wielding weapons or using tools in that hand, and imposes a -5 penalty on Skill Checks and Ability Checks keyed to Strength and Dexterity. Severing part of a leg knocks the target Prone, reduces the target's Speed by half, reduces its Carrying Capacity by half, and imposes a -5 penalty on Skill Checks and Ability Checks keyed to Strength and Dexterity. Because of the severity of such an injury, losing part of a limb causes a Persistent Condition that can only be removed by having Surgery successfully performed on you. A Cybernetic Prosthesis negates these reductions and penalties. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","benefit":"Greater Weapon Focus (Lightsabers) You gain a +2 bonus on melee damage rolls with Lightsabers. This bonus stacks with the bonus granted by the Talent. Whenever you make multiple attacks with any type of Lightsaber as part of a Full Attack, you reduce the penalty on your attack rolls by 2. You can take this Talent multiple times; each time you take this Talent, you reduce the penalty on your attack rolls by an additional 2. See also: Maiming Foes When you deal damage with a Lightsaber that is equal to or greater than both the target's current Hit Points and the target's Damage Threshold (that is, when you would deal enough damage to kill your target), you may choose to use this Talent. Instead of dealing full damage, you instead deal half damage to your target and move it -1 step on the Condition Track. In addition, you sever one of your target's arms at the wrist or elbow joint, or one of the target's legs at the knee or ankle joint (your choice). Severing part of an arm prevents the target from wielding weapons or using tools in that hand, and imposes a -5 penalty on Skill Checks and Ability Checks keyed to Strength and Dexterity. Severing part of a leg knocks the target Prone, reduces the target's Speed by half, reduces its Carrying Capacity by half, and imposes a -5 penalty on Skill Checks and Ability Checks keyed to Strength and Dexterity. Because of the severity of such an injury, losing part of a limb causes a Persistent Condition that can only be removed by having Surgery successfully performed on you. A Cybernetic Prosthesis negates these reductions and penalties. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","class":"","category":"","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"b3c5d90b5036f39b","tags":["burst-damage","condition-removal","controller","damage-reduction","defender","force","force-control","force-offense","leader","lightsaber","melee","mobility","scaling","striker","sustained-damage"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.00a9210772a64a19"}}},{"_id":"6a11feaff6b62afb","name":"Unarmed","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"1d6+14","damageType":"kinetic","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":1,"cost":0,"equipped":true,"description":"","properties":[],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"simple","proficiency":"simple","subcategory":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"placeholder":true,"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":16,"flatDamageFormula":"1d6+14","useFlat":true}}}},{"_id":"e57ea6bb8d023b07","name":"Lightsaber","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"2d8+16","damageType":"energy","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":1,"cost":12000,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>The elegant weapon of the Jedi and Sith. A blade of pure energy capable of cutting through nearly anything.</p>\n      <p><strong>Special:</strong> Ignores armor bonuses to Reflex Defense. Can deflect blaster bolts. Critical threat range 19-20. Requires exotic weapon proficiency.</p>","properties":["Lightsaber","Critical 19-20","Exotic","Armor-Piercing"],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"melee","proficiency":"exotic","subcategory":"lightsaber","costNumeric":12000,"category":"lightsaber"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.weapons.weapon-lightsaber"},"swse":{"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":17,"flatDamageFormula":"2d8+16","useFlat":true}}}},{"_id":"833d710bdf4eb043","name":"Lightsaber (with Rapid Strike)","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"3d8+16","damageType":"energy","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":1,"cost":12000,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>The elegant weapon of the Jedi and Sith. A blade of pure energy capable of cutting through nearly anything.</p>\n      <p><strong>Special:</strong> Ignores armor bonuses to Reflex Defense. Can deflect blaster bolts. Critical threat range 19-20. Requires exotic weapon proficiency.</p>","properties":["Lightsaber","Critical 19-20","Exotic","Armor-Piercing"],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"melee","proficiency":"exotic","subcategory":"lightsaber","costNumeric":12000,"category":"lightsaber"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.weapons.weapon-lightsaber"},"swse":{"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":15,"flatDamageFormula":"3d8+16","useFlat":true}}}},{"_id":"069f8543be3da13c","name":"Double-Bladed Lightsaber","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"2d8+16","damageType":"energy","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":2,"cost":24000,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>A lightsaber with blades on both ends. Wielded by some Sith and Jedi, most famously Darth Maul.</p>\n      <p><strong>Special:</strong> Double weapon. Ignores armor bonuses. Can deflect blaster bolts. Critical threat range 19-20. Requires exotic weapon proficiency.</p>","properties":["Lightsaber","Double Weapon","Critical 19-20","Exotic","Armor-Piercing"],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"melee","proficiency":"exotic","subcategory":"lightsaber","costNumeric":24000,"category":"lightsaber"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.weapons.weapon-double-bladed-lightsaber"},"swse":{"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":7,"flatDamageFormula":"2d8+16","useFlat":true}}}},{"_id":"1878bb2f0accdd6c","name":"Double-Bladed Lightsaber","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"2d8+16","damageType":"energy","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":2,"cost":24000,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>A lightsaber with blades on both ends. Wielded by some Sith and Jedi, most famously Darth Maul.</p>\n      <p><strong>Special:</strong> Double weapon. Ignores armor bonuses. Can deflect blaster bolts. Critical threat range 19-20. Requires exotic weapon proficiency.</p>","properties":["Lightsaber","Double Weapon","Critical 19-20","Exotic","Armor-Piercing"],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"melee","proficiency":"exotic","subcategory":"lightsaber","costNumeric":24000,"category":"lightsaber"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.weapons.weapon-double-bladed-lightsaber"},"swse":{"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":7,"flatDamageFormula":"2d8+16","useFlat":true}}}},{"_id":"4868df633f2afc84","name":"Double-Bladed Lightsaber","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"3d8+16","damageType":"energy","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":2,"cost":24000,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>A lightsaber with blades on both ends. Wielded by some Sith and Jedi, most famously Darth Maul.</p>\n      <p><strong>Special:</strong> Double weapon. Ignores armor bonuses. Can deflect blaster bolts. Critical threat range 19-20. Requires exotic weapon proficiency.</p>","properties":["Lightsaber","Double Weapon","Critical 19-20","Exotic","Armor-Piercing"],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"melee","proficiency":"exotic","subcategory":"lightsaber","costNumeric":24000,"category":"lightsaber"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.weapons.weapon-double-bladed-lightsaber"},"swse":{"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":5,"flatDamageFormula":"3d8+16","useFlat":true}}}},{"_id":"3e2aea20fe9ec207","name":"Double-Bladed Lightsaber (with Rapid Strike)","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"3d8+16","damageType":"energy","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":2,"cost":24000,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>A lightsaber with blades on both ends. Wielded by some Sith and Jedi, most famously Darth Maul.</p>\n      <p><strong>Special:</strong> Double weapon. Ignores armor bonuses. Can deflect blaster bolts. Critical threat range 19-20. Requires exotic weapon proficiency.</p>","properties":["Lightsaber","Double Weapon","Critical 19-20","Exotic","Armor-Piercing"],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"melee","proficiency":"exotic","subcategory":"lightsaber","costNumeric":24000,"category":"lightsaber"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.weapons.weapon-double-bladed-lightsaber"},"swse":{"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":5,"flatDamageFormula":"3d8+16","useFlat":true}}}}],"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"import":{"source":"books","raw":{"Size":"Medium","Species":"4th-Degree","Nonheroic Level":0,"Class Levels":{"Medium":4,"Jedi":9,"Droid":3},"Destiny Points":0,"Force Points":2,"Dark Side Points":0,"Initiative":14,"Senses":"Perception +6","Languages":["Basic","Binary"],"Unassigned Languages":1,"Reflex Defense":30,"Flat-Footed Defense":27,"Fortitude Defense":29,"Will Defense":27,"Immune":"Droid Traits , Sapience","Hit Points":89,"Damage Threshold":29,"Speed":"6 Squares ( Walking ); Powerful Charge","Melee Weapons":"Unarmed +16 (1d6+14), Lightsaber +17 (2d8+16), Lightsaber +15 (3d8+16) with Rapid Strike, Double-Bladed Lightsaber +7 (2d8+16) and Double-Bladed Lightsaber +7 (2d8+16), Double-Bladed Lightsaber +5 (3d8+16) and Double-Bladed Lightsaber +5 (3d8+16) with Rapid Strike","Ranged Weapons":"By Weapon +15","Base Attack Bonus":12,"Grapple":16,"Attack Options":["Acrobatic Strike","Mighty Swing","Rapid Strike","Targeting Package"],"Special Actions":["Indomitable","Modification Specialist"],"Force Powers":[],"Force Secrets":[],"Force Techniques":[],"Strength":1