heck Penalty\">Armor Check Penalty</a> while wearing <a href=\"/wiki/Light_Armor\" title=\"Light Armor\">Light Armor</a>."}},"effects":[{"_id":"9781a3c7-4e7e-4af0-9dcc-cdea0524b414","name":"Armor Proficiency (Light)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.armorProficiency.light","mode":5,"value":"true"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Armor Proficiency (Light)","effectType":"armor_proficiency"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.773ec00effc7e96f"}}},{"_id":"885093c58468eb26","name":"Armor Proficiency (medium)","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You are proficient with medium armor and do not take armor check penalties on attack rolls.","prerequisite":"Armor Proficiency (Light)","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":85,"tags":["armor","defender","feat-chain","non-force","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"No penalty on attacks and no <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Armor_Check_Penalty\" title=\"Armor Check Penalty\">Armor Check Penalty</a> while wearing <a href=\"/wiki/Light_Armor\" title=\"Light Armor\">Light Armor</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armor\" title=\"Medium Armor\">Medium Armor</a>."}},"effects":[{"_id":"af0983df-e771-4593-8f88-f0aa43612597","name":"Armor Proficiency (Medium)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.armorProficiency.medium","mode":5,"value":"true"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Armor Proficiency (Medium)","effectType":"armor_proficiency"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.d445051370a88a7f"}}},{"_id":"48bebf568020281c","name":"Charging Fire","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You may make a ranged attack at the end of a charge, taking a -2 penalty on the attack roll.","prerequisite":"Point Blank Shot","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Galaxy at War","page":24,"tags":["feat-chain","mobility","non-force","positioning","ranged","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Make ranged attack at end of a <a href=\"/wiki/Charge\" title=\"Charge\">Charge</a>; take a -2 penalty to <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a>."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"bab","min":4}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.a945e2f5ffb5a7ed"}}},{"_id":"a6ec54dd4a8374c3","name":"Coordinated Attack","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"When you and an ally both attack the same target in the same round, you each gain a +1 bonus to attack rolls against that target.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":85,"tags":["noble","non-force","soldier","striker","support","sustained-damage"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Noble"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Automatic success with <a href=\"/wiki/Aid_Another\" title=\"Aid Another\">Aid Another</a> action at Point-Blank <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Range\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"bab","min":2}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[{"_id":"64b1c39a-2f16-43e4-aa8b-0ee213caf7a2","name":"Coordinated Attack","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Coordinated Attack","effectType":"combat_bonus","requiresCustomLogic":true}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.964f0781b3e3fc37"}}},{"_id":"7616f517630ed647","name":"Double Attack","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You may make two attacks on your turn as a full-round action, each at a -5 penalty.","prerequisite":"Base attack bonus +6","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":86,"tags":["action-economy","feat-chain","non-force","soldier","sustained-damage"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Make an extra attack with chosen weapon during <a href=\"/wiki/Full_Attack\" title=\"Full Attack\">Full Attack</a>, -5 penalty to all attacks."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"bab","min":6}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.357807a5ceb77203"}}},{"_id":"5b77e5fc2787631f","name":"Linguist","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You gain a number of additional Languages equal to 1 + your Intelligence modifier (Minimum 1). If your Intelligence modifier increases so does the number of languages granted by this Feat.","prerequisite":"Int 13","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["feat-chain","leader","noble","non-force","striker"],"bonus_feat_for":["Noble"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Gain bonus <a href=\"/wiki/Languages\" title=\"Languages\">Languages</a> equal to 1 + your <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> modifier (minimum 1)."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"attribute","ability":"int","min":13}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.5afd91fb081e576b"}}},{"_id":"875a9565abcb2c6f","name":"Point-Blank Shot","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["non-force","ranged"],"bonus_feat_for":[],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"+1 bonus on ranged attacks and damage against foes within Point-Blank <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Range\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>."}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.05459ac4d439f229"}}},{"_id":"942d5506e4d1d58e","name":"Precise Shot","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You do not take the -5 penalty for firing into melee.","prerequisite":"Point Blank Shot","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":88,"tags":["feat-chain","melee","non-force","precision","ranged","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"No -5 penalty for shooting into melee."}},"effects":[{"_id":"77e126ab-16c9-4116-9d67-b5550c007b1b","name":"Precise Shot","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Precise Shot","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Precise Shot"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.c180eee7d3bc29b2"}}},{"_id":"30ecc0220644db73","name":"Rapid Shot","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"When making a full attack with a ranged weapon, you may make one additional attack. All attacks take a -2 penalty.","prerequisite":"Dex 13","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":88,"tags":["feat-chain","non-force","positioning","ranged","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Take a -2 penalty on a ranged attack roll to deal +1 die of damage."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"bab","min":1}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.94b8751efb03536a"}}},{"_id":"54fcf8304c2f9288","name":"Shake It Off","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"Spend two Swift Actions to move +1 step along the Condition Track.","prerequisite":"Constitution 13, Trained in Endurance","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["action-economy","condition-removal","controller","feat-chain","mobility","non-force","striker"],"bonus_feat_for":[],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Spend two <a href=\"/wiki/Swift_Actions\" title=\"Swift Actions\">Swift Actions</a> to move +1 step along the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Condition_Track\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"attribute","ability":"con","min":13},{"type":"skillTrained","skill":"35df8faa4878f2c5"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.3036290329d5b3e6"}}},{"_id":"f8c4d4435a806caa","name":"Skill Focus","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You gain a +5 bonus on all checks with the selected skill.","prerequisite":"Trained in the chosen skill","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":88,"tags":["feat-chain","noble","non-force","scoundrel","striker"],"bonus_feat_for":["Noble","Scoundrel"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Gain +5 competence bonus on <a href=\"/wiki/Skill_Checks\" title=\"Skill Checks\">Skill Checks</a> with one <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Trained_Skill\" title=\"Trained Skill\">Trained Skill</a>."}},"effects":[{"name":"Skill Focus","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.skills.perception.miscMod","mode":2,"value":"5","priority":20}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"transfer":true,"flags":{"swse":{"type":"skill-bonus","skill":"43c5941072ec78af","source":"Skill Focus"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.1592aaedf4b6e40a"}}},{"_id":"626cbd2ab9e6ea6c","name":"Skill Training","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You become trained in one additional skill. You may take this feat multiple times.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":88,"tags":["noble","non-force","scaling","scoundrel","striker"],"bonus_feat_for":["Noble","Scoundrel"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"You become <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Trained\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in one Class Skill."}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.a9f6de36f24ef202"}}},{"_id":"098bd59680dae9d6","name":"Skill Training","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You become trained in one additional skill. You may take this feat multiple times.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":88,"tags":["noble","non-force","scaling","scoundrel","striker"],"bonus_feat_for":["Noble","Scoundrel"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"You become <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Trained\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in one Class Skill."}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.a9f6de36f24ef202"}}},{"_id":"5d82b824f931785f","name":"Weapon Focus","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You gain a +1 bonus on attack rolls with the selected weapon group.","prerequisite":"Proficient with selected weapon group","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":88,"tags":["feat-chain","non-force","soldier","striker"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"+1 bonus on attack rolls with chosen weapon."}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.c41814601364b643"}}},{"_id":"4829cca5e1a415a2","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You are proficient with pistols and do not take the -5 penalty when using them.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["non-force","ranged","scoundrel","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout","Scoundrel"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{}},"effects":[{"_id":"04733e85-193e-4f4b-8792-c359083557d1","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.e5d361d01d1b44e4"}}},{"_id":"72416c888e66e543","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You are proficient with rifles and do not take the -5 penalty when using them.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["non-force","ranged","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{}},"effects":[{"_id":"3b695d0d-747b-4081-8b6c-8b5f8584ff43","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.765ff8a34e58acac"}}},{"_id":"a6521b345d288814","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You are proficient with simple weapons and do not take the -5 penalty when using them.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["noble","non-force","scoundrel","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout","Scoundrel","Noble"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{}},"effects":[{"_id":"220daaa7-e1b5-440d-98cd-10f5e586ef8b","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.2d680cc46a7972da"}}},{"_id":"536b30bf8592c4c9","name":"Acute Senses","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Master Scout","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Keen Shot You are skilled at fighting armored characters, taking advantage of their weaknesses. You can use each of the following Actions once per encounter: Binding Hit: You dislodge an enemy's Armor, causing it to hinder the wearer's defenses. Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If you hit and damage your target, the target loses its Armor bonus to its Reflex Defense and is Flat-Footed. This effect remains until the target spends a Standard Action to adjust its Armor. Blinding Fire: Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If the attack hits and damages the target, the target takes a -2 penalty to all attacks until the end of your next turn. Additionally, all other creatures, Droids, and Vehicles have Concealment from the target until the end of your next turn. Slowing Shot: Your hit damages your target's Armor so that the target's movement is hindered. Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If you hit and damage the target, the target's Speed is reduced by two squares until the end of your next turn.","description":"Keen Shot You are skilled at fighting armored characters, taking advantage of their weaknesses. You can use each of the following Actions once per encounter: Binding Hit: You dislodge an enemy's Armor, causing it to hinder the wearer's defenses. Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If you hit and damage your target, the target loses its Armor bonus to its Reflex Defense and is Flat-Footed. This effect remains until the target spends a Standard Action to adjust its Armor. Blinding Fire: Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If the attack hits and damages the target, the target takes a -2 penalty to all attacks until the end of your next turn. Additionally, all other creatures, Droids, and Vehicles have Concealment from the target until the end of your next turn. Slowing Shot: Your hit damages your target's Armor so that the target's movement is hindered. Make a melee or ranged attack as a Standard Action. If you hit and damage the target, the target's Speed is reduced by two squares until the end of your next turn.","class":"Scout","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scout","tree":"Master Scout","treeId":"dca33c0215264a02","tags":["action-economy","armor","controller","damage-reduction","defender","force","force-control","force-defense","force-offense","melee","mobility","positioning","ranged","scout","striker","support"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.acute_senses"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.f0166d26d9f6252a"}}},{"_id":"588911f39352264d","name":"Battle Analysis","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Commando","prerequisites":"Trained in Initiative","benefit":"When you make a ranged attack with a Pistol or Rifle, all allies within 6 squares of you when you made the attack gain a +1 bonus to Reflex Defense until the start of your next turn. Allies within range don't need to be within your line of sight to gain the bonus. When you use the Mechanics skill to Handle Explosives, the explosion deals +2 dice of damage. You may take this Talent multiple times; its effects stack. You can distract opponents and convince them that you are the most tempting (or most dangerous) target in the area. As a Swift Action, make a Persuasion check and compare the result to the Will Defense of all opponents within line of sight. If the check result exceeds an opponent's Will Defense, that opponent cannot attack any character within 6 squares of you until the start of your next turn as long as you do not have Cover against that opponent. (The affected opponent may still attack you, however.) If you are the Pilot of a Vehicle, you may use this Talent to protect allied Vehicles. You may use it to protect Vehicles no more than one size category larger than your own. Once per round, you may spend a Swift Action to shield a single adjacent ally from attacks, taking the damage and suffering the ill effects in your ally's stead. Until the start of your next turn, any attack made against the protected ally targets you instead. You may elect not to shield your protected ally against a given attack, provided the decision is made before the attack roll is made. If you are the Pilot of a Vehicle, you may use this Talent to protect allied Vehicles. You may use it to protect Vehicles no more than one size category larger than your own. Once per day as a Swift Action, you can move +5 steps on the Condition Track. This does not remove any Persistent Conditions that may be affecting you. This Talent does not affect the Condition Track of a Vehicle. You can select this talent multiple times. Each time you select this Talent, you can use it one additional time per day. You can catch a Second Wind one extra time per day. If you have this Talent and the Extra Second Wind feat, you can catch your Second Wind a total of three times per day. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue Prerequisite: Whenever you have the benefit of Cover, you can spend two Swift Actions to treat it as Improved Cover until the start of your next turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Threats of the Galaxy Prerequisite: When one or more allies uses the Aid Another Action to give you a bonus to your attack roll, you gain a circumstance bonus equal to the total bonus provided to your damage roll. Homebrew Reference Book: Legacy of the Force Sourcebook You add an additional die of damage when attacking with any weapon that has a Burst radius.","description":"When you make a ranged attack with a Pistol or Rifle, all allies within 6 squares of you when you made the attack gain a +1 bonus to Reflex Defense until the start of your next turn. Allies within range don't need to be within your line of sight to gain the bonus. When you use the Mechanics skill to Handle Explosives, the explosion deals +2 dice of damage. You may take this Talent multiple times; its effects stack. You can distract opponents and convince them that you are the most tempting (or most dangerous) target in the area. As a Swift Action, make a Persuasion check and compare the result to the Will Defense of all opponents within line of sight. If the check result exceeds an opponent's Will Defense, that opponent cannot attack any character within 6 squares of you until the start of your next turn as long as you do not have Cover against that opponent. (The affected opponent may still attack you, however.) If you are the Pilot of a Vehicle, you may use this Talent to protect allied Vehicles. You may use it to protect Vehicles no more than one size category larger than your own. Once per round, you may spend a Swift Action to shield a single adjacent ally from attacks, taking the damage and suffering the ill effects in your ally's stead. Until the start of your next turn, any attack made against the protected ally targets you instead. You may elect not to shield your protected ally against a given attack, provided the decision is made before the attack roll is made. If you are the Pilot of a Vehicle, you may use this Talent to protect allied Vehicles. You may use it to protect Vehicles no more than one size category larger than your own. Once per day as a Swift Action, you can move +5 steps on the Condition Track. This does not remove any Persistent Conditions that may be affecting you. This Talent does not affect the Condition Track of a Vehicle. You can select this talent multiple times. Each time you select this Talent, you can use it one additional time per day. You can catch a Second Wind one extra time per day. If you have this Talent and the Extra Second Wind feat, you can catch your Second Wind a total of three times per day. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue Prerequisite: Whenever you have the benefit of Cover, you can spend two Swift Actions to treat it as Improved Cover until the start of your next turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Threats of the Galaxy Prerequisite: When one or more allies uses the Aid Another Action to give you a bonus to your attack roll, you gain a circumstance bonus equal to the total bonus provided to your damage roll. Homebrew Reference Book: Legacy of the Force Sourcebook You add an additional die of damage when attacking with any weapon that has a Burst radius.","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","tree":"Commando","treeId":"798ed0945cbdac1c","tags":["action-economy","battlefield-control","burst-damage","condition-removal","controller","defender","feat-chain","force","force-control","force-defense","force-offense","mechanics","mobility","piloting","positioning","ranged","scaling","shields","skills","social","soldier","striker","support","sustained-damage","talent-chain"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.battle_analysis"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.7df2e8e4f18dc909"}}},{"_id":"a312bb324871f5c4","name":"Born Leader","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Naval Officer","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Prerequisites: Charisma 13, Intelligence 13, When you are the Commander of a Capital Ship, calculate its Reflex Defense using your Heroic Level plus one-half the ship's armor bonus (rounded down), the Pilot's Heroic Level, or the ship's Armor bonus, whichever is highest. In addition, all Gunners on your ship add one-half your Heroic Level, or one-half their Heroic Level, whichever is more, to damage rolls with Vehicle Weapons. Finally, you treat any generic crew as being one quality level higher (maximum of Ace, see Crew Quality).","description":"Prerequisites: Charisma 13, Intelligence 13, When you are the Commander of a Capital Ship, calculate its Reflex Defense using your Heroic Level plus one-half the ship's armor bonus (rounded down), the Pilot's Heroic Level, or the ship's Armor bonus, whichever is highest. In addition, all Gunners on your ship add one-half your Heroic Level, or one-half their Heroic Level, whichever is more, to damage rolls with Vehicle Weapons. Finally, you treat any generic crew as being one quality level higher (maximum of Ace, see Crew Quality).","class":"Noble","costNumeric":null,"category":"Noble","tree":"Naval Officer","treeId":"057a978a7dc1d5a7","tags":["armor","defender","noble","striker","support","sustained-damage"]},"effects":[{"_id":"f9275c38-3cb5-4ab3-aaa5-25e5722dcdd3","name":"Born Leader","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.defenses.will","mode":2,"value":"1"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Born Leader"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.born_leader"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.6a66ba6e0834dd6f"}}},{"_id":"934503b381027074","name":"Cover Fire","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Commando","prerequisites":"Battle Analysis","benefit":"When you make a ranged attack, allies within 6 squares gain +1 Defense until your next turn.","description":"","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","id":"swse.talent.battle_analysis"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"798ed0945cbdac1c","tree":"Commando","tags":["defender","feat-chain","positioning","ranged","soldier","striker","talent-chain"]},"effects":[{"_id":"6a421fc4-15d4-4819-8d96-a2ffb7283d28","name":"Cover Fire","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.defenses.all","mode":2,"value":"1"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","