"name":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You are proficient with simple weapons and do not take the -5 penalty when using them.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["noble","non-force","scoundrel","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout","Scoundrel","Noble"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{}},"effects":[{"_id":"220daaa7-e1b5-440d-98cd-10f5e586ef8b","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.2d680cc46a7972da"}}},{"_id":"fcaf263a4e44e55a","name":"Hidden Movement","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Camouflage","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Improved Stealth Any situation that would give you Concealment grants you Total Concealment instead. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War When Prone, you can spend a Swift Action to gain Concealment until the start of your next turn. If you stand up or move, you lose this benefit. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions Prerequisites: , Improved Stealth Once per encounter, when you are within 2 squares of Cover or Concealment, you can move to that Cover or Concealment and make a Stealth check to hide as a single Move Action. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy Prerequisites: , Improved Stealth You excel at fighting from the shadows, hitting your opponents when they least expect it. You can use each of the following actions once per encounter as a Standard Action: Blinding Strike: Make a single melee or ranged attack against an opponent within Range. If you damage the target, you gain Total Concealment against that target until the beginning of your next turn. Confusing Strike: Make a single melee or ranged attack against an opponent within Range. If this opponent is denied its Dexterity bonus to its Reflex Defense, or if you have Concealment from this opponent, a successful attack also causes the opponent to be able to take only a Swift Action on its next turn. Unexpected Attack: Make a melee or ranged attack within your Range against an opponent from whom you have Concealment. You gain a +2 bonus on this attack roll if you have Concealment, or a +5 bonus if you have Total Concealment. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War When you would normally provoke an Attack of Opportunity by moving out of a Threatened Area, you can roll a Stealth check, replacing your Reflex Defense with the results of your Stealth check if it is higher.","description":"Improved Stealth Any situation that would give you Concealment grants you Total Concealment instead. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War When Prone, you can spend a Swift Action to gain Concealment until the start of your next turn. If you stand up or move, you lose this benefit. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions Prerequisites: , Improved Stealth Once per encounter, when you are within 2 squares of Cover or Concealment, you can move to that Cover or Concealment and make a Stealth check to hide as a single Move Action. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy Prerequisites: , Improved Stealth You excel at fighting from the shadows, hitting your opponents when they least expect it. You can use each of the following actions once per encounter as a Standard Action: Blinding Strike: Make a single melee or ranged attack against an opponent within Range. If you damage the target, you gain Total Concealment against that target until the beginning of your next turn. Confusing Strike: Make a single melee or ranged attack against an opponent within Range. If this opponent is denied its Dexterity bonus to its Reflex Defense, or if you have Concealment from this opponent, a successful attack also causes the opponent to be able to take only a Swift Action on its next turn. Unexpected Attack: Make a melee or ranged attack within your Range against an opponent from whom you have Concealment. You gain a +2 bonus on this attack roll if you have Concealment, or a +5 bonus if you have Total Concealment. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War When you would normally provoke an Attack of Opportunity by moving out of a Threatened Area, you can roll a Stealth check, replacing your Reflex Defense with the results of your Stealth check if it is higher.","class":"Scout","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scout","tree":"Camouflage","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","id":"swse.talent.improved_stealth"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"3926d582d2077489","tags":["action-economy","battlefield-control","controller","defender","leader","melee","mobility","positioning","ranged","scaling","scout","skills","stealth","striker","support"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.hidden_movement"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.d0dad96e182d63d4"}}},{"_id":"27f7efd8bee0cb99","name":"Improved Stealth","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Camouflage","prerequisites":"","benefit":"You're very good at hiding when mobile. You take no penalty on your Stealth check when moving your normal Speed. This Talent applies to Stealth checks made while Piloting a Starship (see Starship Stealth). You may choose to reroll any Stealth check, but the result of the reroll must be accepted, even if it is worse. This Talent applies to Stealth checks made while Piloting a Starship (see Starship Stealth). Prerequisite: During a Surprise Round, if you make a ranged attack against a target that is Surprised, you can Aim at the target as a Free Action. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War If you start your turn with Total Concealment or Total Cover from a target, during that turn you can make a Stealth check as a Swift Action, opposed by the target's Perception check. If you succeed, the target is considered Flat-Footed against you until the end of your turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy","description":"You're very good at hiding when mobile. You take no penalty on your Stealth check when moving your normal Speed. This Talent applies to Stealth checks made while Piloting a Starship (see Starship Stealth). You may choose to reroll any Stealth check, but the result of the reroll must be accepted, even if it is worse. This Talent applies to Stealth checks made while Piloting a Starship (see Starship Stealth). Prerequisite: During a Surprise Round, if you make a ranged attack against a target that is Surprised, you can Aim at the target as a Free Action. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War If you start your turn with Total Concealment or Total Cover from a target, during that turn you can make a Stealth check as a Swift Action, opposed by the target's Perception check. If you succeed, the target is considered Flat-Footed against you until the end of your turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy","class":"Scout","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scout","tree":"Camouflage","treeId":"3926d582d2077489","tags":["action-economy","ambush","controller","mobility","perception","piloting","positioning","ranged","scout","skills","stealth","sustained-damage"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.improved_stealth"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.073115894cad8cf9"}}},{"_id":"9bea39854a488e78","name":"Unarmed","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"1d3-1","damageType":"kinetic","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":1,"cost":0,"equipped":true,"description":"","properties":[],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"simple","proficiency":"simple","subcategory":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"placeholder":true,"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":1,"flatDamageFormula":"1d3-1","useFlat":true}}}},{"_id":"2fd1d43589eae49d","name":"Hold-Out Blaster Pistol","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"3d4+1","damageType":"energy","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"dex","range":"ranged","weight":0.5,"cost":300,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>A small, easily concealed blaster pistol.</p>","properties":["Illegal","Inaccurate"],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"ranged","proficiency":"pistols","subcategory":"pistol","costNumeric":300,"category":"pistol"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.weapons.weapon-hold-out-blaster-pistol"},"swse":{"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":2,"flatDamageFormula":"3d4+1","useFlat":true}}}}],"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"import":{"source":"books","raw":{"Size":"Small","Species":"Chadra-Fan","Nonheroic Level":0,"Class Levels":{"Scout":3},"Destiny Points":0,"Force Points":1,"Dark Side Points":1,"Initiative":6,"Senses":"Darkvision, Perception +12","Languages":["Basic","Chadra-Fan"],"Unassigned Languages":0,"Reflex Defense":16,"Flat-Footed Defense":15,"Fortitude Defense":13,"Will Defense":14,"Hit Points":30,"Damage Threshold":13,"Speed":"4 Squares; Hidden Movement","Melee Weapons":"Unarmed +1 (1d3-1)","Ranged Weapons":"Hold-Out Blaster Pistol +2 (3d4+1)","Base Attack Bonus":2,"Attack Options":[],"Special Actions":["Quick Draw"],"Force Powers":[],"Force Secrets":[],"Force Techniques":[],"Strength":8,"Dexterity":10,"Constitution":8,"Intelligence":10,"Wisdom":12,"Charisma":10,"Talents":["Talents : Hidden Movement","Improved Stealth"],"Feats":["Feats : Quick Draw","Skill Focus (Perception)","Skill Focus (Stealth)","Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)","Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)","Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"],"Skills":["Skills : Climb","Initiative","Knowledge (Social Sciences)","Perception","must take second result)","Stealth","must take second result)"],"Trained Skills":["Skills : Climb","Initiative","Knowledge (Social Sciences)","Perception","must take second result)","Stealth","must take second result)"],"Species Traits":[],"Gear":"Hold-Out Blaster Pistol , Comlink (Short-Range), Credit Chip , Datapad"},"mode":"play","sourcePack":"heroic","sourceAuthority":"statblock","playReady":true,"normalizedForPlay":true,"playNormalizationVersion":1}}}}
