</strong> Defensive Acuity, Weapon Finesse</p>\n<p><strong>Special Actions:</strong> Droidcraft, Expert Droid Repair, Superior Tech (Droids), Tech Specialist</p>","derived":{},"npcProfile":{"kind":"heroic","mode":"play","sourceAuthority":"statblock","legalProfile":"heroic","legalState":"unchecked","importMode":"play","playReady":true,"statblockAuthority":true,"sourcePack":"heroic","normalizationVersion":1,"authority":{"hp":"statblock","defenses":"statblock","bab":"statblock","attacks":"statblock","skills":"statblock","damageThreshold":"statblock"}}},"items":[{"_id":"65b1834bed6366b5","name":"Chadra-Fan","type":"species","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"size":"Small","speed":6,"abilities":"+2 Dex, -2 Str, -2 Wis","skillBonuses":["+2 Perception","+2 Mechanics"],"special":["Echolocation"],"languages":["Chadra-Fan","Basic"],"source":"Rebellion","description":"","tags":[],"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":5500,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.species.species-chadra-fan"}}},{"_id":"ebe08010d20604c5","name":"Brilliant Defense","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Galaxy of Intrigue","page":16,"tags":["defender","non-force"],"bonus_feat_for":[],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Add your <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> bonus to your <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> as a <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>."}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.e0cdeb7d44cf44fd"}}},{"_id":"4698ad5e4ca4e16c","name":"Dodge","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"During your turn, you designate an opponent and receive a +1 dodge bonus to your Reflex Defense against attacks from that opponent. You can select a new opponent on any action. A situation that makes you lose your Dexterity bonus to Reflex Defense (if any) also makes you lose dodge bonuses. Also, dodge bonuses stack with each other, unlike most other types of bonuses.","prerequisite":"Dex 13","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":84,"tags":["action-economy","defender","evasion","feat-chain","non-force","scaling","scout","striker"],"bonus_feat_for":["Scout"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Gain a +1 dodge bonus to <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> against a selected target."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"attribute","ability":"dex","min":13}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[{"name":"Dodge","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.defenses.reflex.misc","mode":2,"value":"1","priority":20}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"transfer":true,"flags":{"swse":{"type":"feat-defense-bonus","source":"Dodge","defenseType":"reflex"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.45366d4f3a5e443d"}}},{"_id":"667e42998073fc63","name":"Droidcraft","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Clone Wars Campaign Guide","page":21,"tags":["non-force"],"bonus_feat_for":[],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Repair\" title=\"Repair\">Repair</a> a Droid in 10 minutes instead of 1 hour."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"skillTrained","skill":"745a5686d6f21e8c"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[],"