e Attack (Pistols), Point-Blank Shot</p>\n<p><strong>Special Actions:</strong> Fool's Luck, Fortune's Favor, Gambler</p>","derived":{},"npcProfile":{"kind":"heroic","mode":"play","sourceAuthority":"statblock","legalProfile":"heroic","legalState":"unchecked","importMode":"play","playReady":true,"statblockAuthority":true,"sourcePack":"heroic","normalizationVersion":1,"authority":{"hp":"statblock","defenses":"statblock","bab":"statblock","attacks":"statblock","skills":"statblock","damageThreshold":"statblock"}}},"items":[{"_id":"9d3b2dd374fabc52","name":"Human","type":"species","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"size":"Medium","speed":6,"abilities":"None","skillBonuses":[],"special":["Bonus Feat: Humans gain one bonus feat at 1st level","Bonus Trained Skill: Humans gain one additional trained skill at 1st level"],"languages":["Basic"],"source":"Core","description":"","tags":[],"visionTraits":[],"naturalWeapons":[],"movementTraits":[],"environmentalTraits":[],"combatTraits":{"naturalArmor":0,"weaponProficiencies":[],"otherTraits":[]},"techTraits":[],"forceTraits":[],"socialTraits":[],"bonusFeats":1,"bonusTrainedSkills":1,"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":700,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.species.species-human"}}},{"_id":"3aadeae1b90b22a1","name":"Dodge","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"During your turn, you designate an opponent and receive a +1 dodge bonus to your Reflex Defense against attacks from that opponent. You can select a new opponent on any action. A situation that makes you lose your Dexterity bonus to Reflex Defense (if any) also makes you lose dodge bonuses. Also, dodge bonuses stack with each other, unlike most other types of bonuses.","prerequisite":"Dex 13","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":84,"tags":["action-economy","defender","evasion","feat-chain","non-force","scaling","sco