haracter. Homebrew Reference Book: Legacy of the Force Sourcebook When attacking with a Light Melee weapon, a Lightsaber, or any other weapon that benefits from the Weapon Finesse Feat, you may add an additional point of damage on a successful attack.","benefit":"Whenever you deal damage to an opponent denied its Dexterity bonus to its Reflex Defense, you can choose not to move the target down the Condition Track and instead impose a -5 penalty on all your opponent's attack and melee damage rolls until the end of your next turn. Homebrew Reference Book: Legacy of the Force Sourcebook At the start of your turn, you may spend a Force Point. Until the start of your next turn, you can make an Attack of Opportunity against a single opponent that has just taken damage from another character. Homebrew Reference Book: Legacy of the Force Sourcebook When attacking with a Light Melee weapon, a Lightsaber, or any other weapon that benefits from the Weapon Finesse Feat, you may add an additional point of damage on a successful attack.","class":"","category":"","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"67b59e020c1660eb","tags":["condition-removal","controller","defender","feat-chain","force","force-control","force-defense","force-offense","lightsaber","melee","mobility","striker","talent-chain"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.9e4345faaaa94dd8"}}},{"_id":"8d398f8728dcf97c","name":"Fool's Luck","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Fortune","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Once per encounter, you can turn a Critical Hit against you into a normal hit. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy Prerequisite: Once per encounter, as a Reaction, you gain a +5 luck bonus to any one Defense until the start of your next turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy","description":"Once per encounter, you can turn a Critical Hit against you into a normal hit. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy Prerequisite: Once per encounter, as a Reaction, you gain a +5 luck bonus to any one Defense until the start of your next turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy","class":"Scoundrel","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scoundrel","tree":"Fortune","treeId":"cee9b9398682b7d0","tags":["action-economy","defender","precision","scoundrel","striker"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.fools_luck"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.5319a796f2c4ff64"}}},{"_id":"5902c6205ee27a30","name":"Fortune's Favor","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Fortune","prerequisites":null,"benefit":"When you score a critical hit, gain a free standard action; must be used before your next turn or it is lost.","description":"When you score a critical hit, gain a free standard action before your next turn.","class":"Scoundrel","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scoundrel","tree":"Fortune","treeId":"cee9b9398682b7d0","tags":["action-economy","precision","scoundrel","striker"]},"effects":[{"_id":"1318c3b8-7232-43b2-8a09-ec77ce56584f","name":"Fortune's Favor","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.actions.free_standard","mode":2,"value":"1"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Fortune's Favor"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.fortunes_favor"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.aacde500ec811cd4"}}},{"_id":"2bcda807109e4d93","name":"Gambler","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Fortune","prerequisites":"","benefit":"You may reroll any Wisdom check when you Gamble, but must take the second result, even if it is worse. When Gambling against other characters, you must decide to reroll before the results of your opponents are revealed. 