Knight's Armor","prerequisites":"","benefit":"When calculating your Reflex Defense, you may add your Heroic Level plus one-half your Armor bonus (rounded down), or your Armor bonus alone, whichever is higher. This Talent counts as both the Talent and the Improved Talent for the purposes of prerequisites. You are adept at using a Cortosis Gauntlet to parry Lightsaber attacks. You gain a +2 bonus when making an opposed Unarmed melee attack roll against a Lightsaber attack.","description":"When calculating your Reflex Defense, you may add your Heroic Level plus one-half your Armor bonus (rounded down), or your Armor bonus alone, whichever is higher. This Talent counts as both the Talent and the Improved Talent for the purposes of prerequisites. You are adept at using a Cortosis Gauntlet to parry Lightsaber attacks. You gain a +2 bonus when making an opposed Unarmed melee attack roll against a Lightsaber attack.","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","tree":"Knight's Armor","treeId":"ea01d740c91888b3","tags":["armor","defender","lightsaber","melee","scaling","soldier","striker","sustained-damage","unarmed"]},"effects":[{"_id":"28f1f3db-0c6f-4614-bdcf-000f1542a25b","name":"Armored Defense","icon":"icons/svg/shield.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.defenses.reflex.misc","mode":2,"value":"1","priority":20}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Armored Defense"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.armored_defense"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.4c236343b01ea763"}}},{"_id":"e6e9f1aa600b5b41","name":"Devastating Attack","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Weapon Master","prerequisites":"","benefit":"This replaces the effects of the Talent.","description":"This replaces the effects of the Talent.","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","tree":"Weapon Master","treeId":"2f720d8b061f9bd0","tags":["soldier"]},"effects":[{"_id":"69f7a1a0-603e-4b5e-a42a-15f770230266","name":"Devastating Attack","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.combat.weaponGroupThresholdReduction","mode":2,"value":"5"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Devastating Attack","effectType":"threshold_reduction","weaponGroupSpecific":true,"notes":"Weapon group specific - applies when using designated weapon group"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.devastating_attack"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.383915a7d11e1225"}}},{"_id":"d939e5e467833491","name":"Greater Devastating Attack","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Weapon Master","prerequisites":"Greater Weapon Focus, Devastating Attack","benefit":"With the chosen proficient weapon, reduce target's damage threshold by 10 (replaces Devastating Attack).","description":"With a chosen weapon, reduce the target's damage threshold by 10 instead of 5.","class":"Elite Trooper","costNumeric":null,"category":"Elite Trooper","tree":"Weapon Master","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","id":"swse.talent.devastating_attack"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"2f720d8b061f9bd0","tags":["damage-reduction","defender","feat-chain","soldier","striker","talent-chain"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.greater_devastating_attack"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.d3b19d5e369f579d"}}},{"_id":"f549064d8a664eed","name":"Greater Weapon Focus","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Weapon Master","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Prerequisites: (Chosen Weapon), Devastating Attack (Chosen Weapon) Choose a single Exotic Weapon or weapon group with which you're proficient. Whenever you make a successful attack against a target using the chosen Exotic Weapon or weapon from the chosen group, you treat your target's Damage Threshold as if it were 10 points lower when determining the results of your attack. Prerequisites: (Chosen Weapon), Penetrating Attack (Chosen Weapon) Choose a single Exotic Weapon or weapon group with which you're proficient. Whenever you make a successful attack against a target using the chosen Exotic Weapon or weapon from the chosen group, you treat your target's Damage Reduction as if it were 10 points lower when determining the results of your attack. Prerequisites: (Chosen Weapon), Weapon Specialization (Chosen Weapon)","description":"Prerequisites: (Chosen Weapon), Devastating Attack (Chosen Weapon) Choose a single Exotic Weapon or weapon group with which you're proficient. Whenever you make a successful attack against a target using the chosen Exotic Weapon or weapon from the chosen group, you treat your target's Damage Threshold as if it were 10 points lower when determining the results of your attack. Prerequisites: (Chosen Weapon), Penetrating Attack (Chosen Weapon) Choose a single Exotic Weapon or weapon group with which you're proficient. Whenever you make a successful attack against a target using the chosen Exotic Weapon or weapon from the chosen group, you treat your target's Damage Reduction as if it were 10 points lower when determining the results of your attack. Prerequisites: (Chosen Weapon), Weapon Specialization (Chosen Weapon)","class":"Elite Trooper","costNumeric":null,"category":"Elite Trooper","tree":"Weapon Master","treeId":"2f720d8b061f9bd0","tags":["damage-reduction","defender","soldier","striker"]},"effects":[{"_id":"7a2683eb-2396-4638-aa86-e28807081035","name":"Greater Weapon Focus","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.attacks.melee","mode":2,"value":"1"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Greater Weapon Focus"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"sw