obatic Strike, Ataru, Double Attack (Lightsabers), Pack Hunter, Rapid Strike, Weapon Finesse</p>\n<p><strong>Special Actions:</strong> Battle Meditation, Redirect Shot</p>","derived":{},"npcProfile":{"kind":"heroic","mode":"play","sourceAuthority":"statblock","legalProfile":"heroic","legalState":"unchecked","importMode":"play","playReady":true,"statblockAuthority":true,"sourcePack":"heroic","normalizationVersion":1,"authority":{"hp":"statblock","defenses":"statblock","bab":"statblock","attacks":"statblock","skills":"statblock","damageThreshold":"statblock"}}},"items":[{"_id":"ddc0d95a56f2dd8e","name":"Togruta","type":"species","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"size":"medium","speed":6,"abilities":{},"skillBonuses":{},"special":"","languages":[],"source":"","description":"","tags":[]},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"placeholder":true,"unresolved":"Togruta"}}},{"_id":"6b86b034af41386b","name":"Acrobatic Strike","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You can use Acrobatics to tumble through an enemy’s space and gain a +2 bonus on your next melee attack against that enemy.","prerequisite":"Acrobatics 15 ranks","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Galaxy at War","page":23,"tags":["feat-chain","melee","non-force","scout","striker"],"bonus_feat_for":["Scout"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Gain +2 competence bonus on next attack against opponent you <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Tumble\" title=\"Tumble\">Tumble</a> past."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"skillTrained","skill":"a6c5e98148aad9a9"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.419a502e59264382"}}},{"_id":"260e3e38875fb4cf","name":"Double Attack","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You may make two attacks on your turn as a full-round action, each at a -5 penalty.","prerequisite":"Base attack bonus +6","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":86,"tags":["action-economy","feat-chain","non-force","soldier","sustained-damage"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Make an extra attack with chosen weapon during <a href=\"/wiki/Full_Attack\" title=\"Full Attack\">Full Attack</a>, -5 penalty to all attacks."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"bab","min":6}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.357807a5ceb77203"}}},{"_id":"ebd0f2751ba1d382","name":"Force Sensitivity","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"force","benefit":"You can make Use the Force checks and gain access to Force Talents.","prerequisite":"Non-Droid","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":86,"tags":["feat-chain","force"],"bonus_feat_for":[],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"You can make <a href=\"/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> checks and gain access to <a href=\"/wiki/Force_Talents\" title=\"Force Talents\">Force Talents</a>."}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.ddbeb23013d9e917"}}},{"_id":"84b135c72e068e93","name":"Force Training","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"force","benefit":"You learn a number of Force powers equal to 1 + your Wisdom modifier.","prerequisite":"Force Sensitivity, Trained in Use the Force","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":94,"tags":["feat-chain","force","jedi","striker"],"bonus_feat_for":["Jedi"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"forcePowerGrants":1,"description":{"value":"Learn a number of <a href=\"/wiki/Force_Powers\" title=\"Force Powers\">Force Powers</a> equal to 1 + your <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> modifier (minimum 1)."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"skillTrained","skill":"usetheforce"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[{"_id":"d1c60a9b-78e6-4601-85a4-320794fa5a91","name":"Force Training","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Force Training","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Force Training"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.9b7b869a86f39190"}}},{"_id":"24eb4df5710ba3a2","name":"Running Attack","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You may make a single melee or ranged attack at any point during a move action taken on your turn.","prerequisite":"Dex 13","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":88,"tags":["action-economy","controller","feat-chain","melee","mobility","non-force","positioning","ranged","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Scout","Soldier"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Move before and after making an attack."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"attribute","ability":"dex","min":13}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.4d6a68d553fb0449"}}},{"_id":"e5b2332997ec9638","name":"Rapid Strike","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"When making a full attack with a melee weapon, you may make one additional attack. All attacks take a -2 penalty.","prerequisite":"Dex 13","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":88,"tags":["feat-chain","melee","non-force","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Take a -2 penalty on a melee attack roll to deal +1 die of damage."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"bab","min":1}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.ccb33e58342499a3"}}},{"_id":"71fe2ea7ad1c07f9","name":"Skill Focus","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You gain a +5 bonus on all checks with the selected skill.","prerequisite":"Trained in the chosen skill","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":88,"tags":["feat-chain","noble","non-force","scoundrel","striker"],"bonus_feat_for":["Noble","Scoundrel"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Gain +5 competence bonus on <a href=\"/wiki/Skill_Checks\" title=\"Skill Checks\">Skill Checks</a> with one <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Trained_Skill\" title=\"Trained Skill\">Trained Skill</a>."}},"effects":[{"name":"Skill Focus","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.skills.perception.miscMod","mode":2,"value":"5","priority":20}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"transfer":true,"flags":{"swse":{"type":"skill-bonus","skill":"43c5941072ec78af","source":"Skill Focus"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.1592aaedf4b6e40a"}}},{"_id":"882f8c5e2d43da31","name":"Weapon Finesse","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You may use your Dexterity modifier instead of Strength for attack rolls with light melee weapons.","prerequisite":"Dex 13","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":88,"tags":["feat-chain","melee","non-force","scoundrel","scout"],"bonus_feat_for":["Scout","Scoundrel"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Use <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> modifier instead of <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> modifier on attack rolls with Light Melee Weapons and <a href=\"/wiki/Lightsabers\" title=\"Lightsabers\">Lightsabers</a>."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"bab","min":1}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.252b67d6e31c377e"}}},{"_id":"bce6e845ee11d7c7","name":"Weapon Focus","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You gain a +1 bonus on attack rolls with the selected weapon group.","prerequisite":"Proficient with selected weapon group","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":88,"tags":["feat-chain","non-force","soldier","striker"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"+1 bonus on attack rolls with chosen weapon."}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.c41814601364b643"}}},{"_id":"7419b4d5d0bde8fb","name":"Weapon Proficiency","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"Ignore -5 penalty on attack rolls with weapons of a particular type.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["non-force"],"bonus_feat_for":[],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"Ignore -5 penalty on attack rolls with weapons of a particular type."}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.ecc2471ac96ec2d4"}}},{"_id":"f282ba2f7123d8f8","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You are proficient with simple weapons and do not take the -5 penalty when using them.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["noble","non-force","scoundrel","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout","Scoundrel","Noble"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{}},"effects":[{"_id":"220daaa7-e1b5-440d-98cd-10f5e586ef8b","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.2d680cc46a7972da"}}},{"_id":"07a8f778d19deb80","name":"Devastating Power","type":"feat","img":"systems/foundryvtt-swse/assets/icons/force-secret.png","system":{"featType":"force","benefit":"When using a Force Power that deals damage, you can spend a Force Point to increase the Power's damage dice by 50%.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Core","page":0,"tags":["force-secret"],"bonus_feat_for":[],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":"<p><strong>Cost:</strong> Force Point or Destiny Point</p><p>When using a Force Power that deals damage, you can spend a Force Point to increase the Power's damage dice by 50%.</p><p>Alternatively, you can spend a Destiny Point to double the amount of damage dice.</p>","cost":"Force Point or Destiny Point","alternativeCost":"Alternatively, you can spend a Destiny Point to double the amount of damage dice."},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcesecrets.996848a2e0c0ac4f"}}},{"_id":"fa6b12dcdc8d6605","name":"Improved Force Trance","type":"feat","img":"systems/foundryvtt-swse/assets/icons/force-technique.png","system":{"featType":"force","benefit":"Each hour you remain in a Force Trance, you regain a number of Hit Points equal to 2 x your Character Level.","prerequisite":"Force Trance","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Core","page":0,"tags":["force-technique"],"bonus_feat_for":[],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"description":"<p>Each hour you remain in a Force Trance, you regain a number of Hit Points equal to 2 x your Character Level.</p><p><strong>Related Power:</strong> Force Trance</p><p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Force Trance</p>","relatedPower":"Force Trance"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcetechniques.93b96db5b560e14a"}}},{"_id":"7920ad4a3e4a9707","name":"Improved Sense Force","type":"feat","img":"systems/foundryvtt-swse/assets/icons/force-technique.png","system":{"featType":"force","benefit":"You may use the Sense Force ability of the Use the Force Skill as a Move Action rather than a Full-Round Action.","prerequisite":"Sense Force","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Core","page":0,"tags":["force-technique"],"bonus_feat_for":[],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"description":"<p>You may use the Sense Force ability of the Use the Force Skill as a Move Action rather than a Full-Round Action.</p><p><strong>Related Power:</strong> Sense Force</p><p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Sense Force</p>","relatedPower":"Sense Force"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcetechniques.ad67b8f3959860f2"}}},{"_id":"75af2ce15c9a9097","name":"Acrobatic Recovery","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Lightsaber Forms","prerequisites":"","benefit":"You may Take 10 on Acrobatics checks to Tumble, even when distracted or threatened. Additionally, each threatened or occupied square that you Tumble through only counts as 1 square of movement.","description":"You may Take 10 on Acrobatics checks to Tumble, even when distracted or threatened. Additionally, each threatened or occupied square that you Tumble through only counts as 1 square of movement.","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","tree":"Lightsaber Forms","treeId":"2bc2572e852832e4","tags":["controller","jedi","lightsaber","melee","mobility","positioning","support"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.acrobatic_recovery"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.5d4a63123e5a5eb4"}}},{"_id":"318f1ffd24dfca99","name":"Ataru","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Lightsaber Forms","prerequisites":null,"benefit":"May apply Dexterity modifier to damage or double Dexterity bonus if two-handed instead of Strength.","description":"Add Dexterity modifier to damage, or double Dexterity bonus if two-handed, instead of Strength.","class":"Jedi Knight","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi Knight","tree":"Lightsaber Forms","treeId":"2bc2572e852832e4","tags":["jedi","lightsaber","melee","striker"]},"effects":[{"_id":"51d31037-d4be-4c4d-a5e5-b405e21aa08a","name":"Ataru - Apply DEX to Damage","icon":"icons/svg/wind.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.abilities.dex.applyToDamage","mode":5,"value":"true","priority":20}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Ataru"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.ataru"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.0b3f4075ed84aee0"}}},{"_id":"cc49e434f1adfd6f","name":"Battle Meditation","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Sense","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Link Using a meditative battle trance, Force-users are able to join their minds together, collectively becoming stronger. However, a masterful degree of will is required to prevent the participants from sharing their weaknesses as well as their strengths. As a Full-Round Action, you can designate a number of willing allies equal to your Charisma modifier within 12 squares of you. These allies must be Trained in the Use the Force skill. As long as you remain within 12 squares of each other, you can Aid Another on attack rolls and Skill Checks as a Reaction.","description":"Link Using a meditative battle trance, Force-users are able to join their minds together, collectively becoming stronger. However, a masterful degree of will is required to prevent the participants from sharing their weaknesses as well as their strengths. As a Full-Round Action, you can designate a number of willing allies equal to your Charisma modifier within 12 squares of you. These allies must be Trained in the Use the Force skill. As long as you remain within 12 squares of each other, you can Aid Another on attack rolls and Skill Checks as a Reaction.","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","tree":"Sense","treeId":"d6b4331c0e31f7e3","tags":["action-economy","force","force-offense","jedi","positioning","striker","sustained-damage"]},"effects":[{"_id":"0cdcb68b-7eeb-45d0-ae5c-575d13648a00","name":"Battle Meditation","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.attacks.allies","mode":2,"value":"1"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Battle Meditation"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.battle_meditation"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.9461c7aa79dd07c6"}}},{"_id":"acabbf856c73796d","name":"Block","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Sith Alchemy","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Create Sith Amulet: You can create a Sith Amulet. The creation of a Sith Amulet requires 25,000 credits' worth of gems and other raw materials, and the creation process takes 1 week (this work can be spread out over several sessions and need not be consecutive). At the end of the process, you must spend a Force Point to complete the Sith Amulet, after which point it functions exactly as a Sith Amulet. Create Sith Armor: You can transform a suit of normal Battle Armor into the Dark Armor worn by Sith Lords. You must have a suit of Battle Armor to transform into the Dark Armor (Light Battle Armor becomes Light Dark Armor, Battle Armor becomes Dark Armor, and Heavy Battle Armor becomes Heavy Dark Armor). The transformation process takes 1 day for Light Dark Armor, 2 days for Dark Armor, and 3 days for Heavy Dark Armor. You must spend a Force Point at the end of the creation process to complete the Armor's transformation. Create Sith Talisman: You can spend a Force Point to imbue a portable object with the Dark Side, creating a Sith Talisman that provides offensive strength to a Force Power. Creating the Sith Talisman takes a Full-Round Action. While you wear or carry the Sith Talisman on your person, you add 1d6 to your damage with Force Powers. You increase your Dark Side Score by 1 when you first wear or carry a Sith Talisman. You can have only one Sith Talisman active at any given time, and if it is destroyed, you cannot create another one for 24 hours. Create Sith Weapon: You can alchemically treat a Simple Weapon (Melee) or an Advanced Melee Weapon, turning it into a Sith Weapon. You must spend a Force Point and spend 1 hour imbuing the Weapon with the properties of a Sith Alchemical Weapon (see also: Sith Alchemical Weapon Template). A Lightsaber does not ignore the Sith Weapon's DR, and characters who are proficient in the Weapon's use can treat it as a Lightsaber for the purposes of the , Deflect, and Redirect Shot Talents (and any Talents that have these Talents as a prerequisite). Additionally, as a Swift Action, the wielder of a Sith Weapon can spend a Force Point to gain a bonus equal to their Dark Side Score to the damage of their next attack made with the Weapon before the end of the encounter. This increases the wielder's Dark Side Score by 1.","description":"Create Sith Amulet: You can create a Sith Amulet. The creation of a Sith Amulet requires 25,000 credits' worth of gems and other raw materials, and the creation process takes 1 week (this work can be spread out over several sessions and need not be consecutive). At the end of the process, you must spend a Force Point to complete the Sith Amulet, after which point it functions exactly as a Sith Amulet. Create Sith Armor: You can transform a suit of normal Battle Armor into the Dark Armor worn by Sith Lords. You must have a suit of Battle Armor to transform into the Dark Armor (Light Battle Armor becomes Light Dark Armor, Battle Armor becomes Dark Armor, and Heavy Battle Armor becomes Heavy Dark Armor). The transformation process takes 1 day for Light Dark Armor, 2 days for Dark Armor, and 3 days for Heavy Dark Armor. You must spend a Force Point at the end of the creation process to complete the Armor's transformation. Create Sith Talisman: You can spend a Force Point to imbue a portable object with the Dark Side, creating a Sith Talisman that provides offensive strength to a Force Power. Creating the Sith Talisman takes a Full-Round Action. While you wear or carry the Sith Talisman on your person, you add 1d6 to your damage with Force Powers. You increase your Dark Side Score by 1 when you first wear or carry a Sith Talisman. You can have only one Sith Talisman active at any given time, and if it is destroyed, you cannot create another one for 24 hours. Create Sith Weapon: You can alchemically treat a Simple Weapon (Melee) or an Advanced Melee Weapon, turning it into a Sith Weapon. You must spend a Force Point and spend 1 hour imbuing the Weapon with the properties of a Sith Alchemical Weapon (see also: Sith Alchemical Weapon Template). A Lightsaber does not ignore the Sith Weapon's DR, and characters who are proficient in the Weapon's use can treat it as a Lightsaber for the purposes of the , Deflect, and Redirect Shot Talents (and any Talents that have these Talents as a prerequisite). Additionally, as a Swift Action, the wielder of a Sith Weapon can spend a Force Point to gain a bonus equal to their Dark Side Score to the damage of their next attack made with the Weapon before the end of the encounter. This increases the wielder's Dark Side Score by 1.","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","tree":"Sith Alchemy","treeId":"a67faf2ae089ab5d","tags":["action-economy","armor","dark-side","defender","force","force-offense","jedi","lightsaber","melee","mobility","ranged","striker","support","sustained-damage"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.block"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.9379daa94a228c04"}}},{"_id":"27b7f208d01e7f55","name":"Deflect","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Lightsaber Forms","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Redirect Shot","description":"Redirect Shot","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","tree":"Lightsaber Forms","treeId":"2bc2572e852832e4","tags":["jedi","lightsaber","melee","ranged"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.deflect"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.72c644f7a09b1186"}}},{"_id":"c5c7eb7ba75d9a1c","name":"Redirect Shot","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Lightsaber Forms","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Whenever you redirect a deflected blaster bolt (see the Talent), you gain a +5 bonus on your ranged attack roll.","description":"Whenever you redirect a deflected blaster bolt (see the Talent), you gain a +5 bonus on your ranged attack roll.","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","tree":"Lightsaber Forms","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","id":"swse.talent.deflect"},{"type":"bab","min":5}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"2bc2572e852832e4","tags":["jedi","lightsaber","melee","positioning","ranged","striker"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.redirect_shot"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.941c1dfd00e697da"}}},{"_id":"b63882375dbfd6b7","name":"Weapon Specialization (Lightsabers)","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Duelist","tree":"Duelist","prerequisites":"","description":"Greater Weapon Focus (Lightsabers) You gain a +2 bonus on melee damage rolls with Lightsabers. This bonus stacks with the bonus granted by the Talent. Whenever you make multiple attacks with any type of Lightsaber as part of a Full Attack, you reduce the penalty on your attack rolls by 2. You can take this Talent multiple times; each time you take this Talent, you reduce the penalty on your attack rolls by an additional 2. See also: Maiming Foes When you deal damage with a Lightsaber that is equal to or greater than both the target's current Hit Points and the target's Damage Threshold (that is, when you would deal enough damage to kill your target), you may choose to use this Talent. Instead of dealing full damage, you instead deal half damage to your target and move it -1 step on the Condition Track. In addition, you sever one of your target's arms at the wrist or elbow joint, or one of the target's legs at the knee or ankle joint (your choice). Severing part of an arm prevents the target from wielding weapons or using tools in that hand, and imposes a -5 penalty on Skill Checks and Ability Checks keyed to Strength and Dexterity. Severing part of a leg knocks the target Prone, reduces the target's Speed by half, reduces its Carrying Capacity by half, and imposes a -5 penalty on Skill Checks and Ability Checks keyed to Strength and Dexterity. Because of the severity of such an injury, losing part of a limb causes a Persistent Condition that can only be removed by having Surgery successfully performed on you. A Cybernetic Prosthesis negates these reductions and penalties. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","benefit":"Greater Weapon Focus (Lightsabers) You gain a +2 bonus on melee damage rolls with Lightsabers. This bonus stacks with the bonus granted by the Talent. Whenever you make multiple attacks with any type of Lightsaber as part of a Full Attack, you reduce the penalty on your attack rolls by 2. You can take this Talent multiple times; each time you take this Talent, you reduce the penalty on your attack rolls by an additional 2. See also: Maiming Foes When you deal damage with a Lightsaber that is equal to or greater than both the target's current Hit Points and the target's Damage Threshold (that is, when you would deal enough damage to kill your target), you may choose to use this Talent. Instead of dealing full damage, you instead deal half damage to your target and move it -1 step on the Condition Track. In addition, you sever one of your target's arms at the wrist or elbow joint, or one of the target's legs at the knee or ankle joint (your choice). Severing part of an arm prevents the target from wielding weapons or using tools in that hand, and imposes a -5 penalty on Skill Checks and Ability Checks keyed to Strength and Dexterity. Severing part of a leg knocks the target Prone, reduces the target's Speed by half, reduces its Carrying Capacity by half, and imposes a -5 penalty on Skill Checks and Ability Checks keyed to Strength and Dexterity. Because of the severity of such an injury, losing part of a limb causes a Persistent Condition that can only be removed by having Surgery successfully performed on you. A Cybernetic Prosthesis negates these reductions and penalties. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","class":"","category":"","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"b3c5d90b5036f39b","tags":["burst-damage","condition-removal","controller","damage-reduction","defender","force","force-control","force-offense","leader","lightsaber","melee","mobility","scaling","striker","sustained-damage"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.00a9210772a64a19"}}},{"_id":"28c62551fd54177e","name":"Battle Strike","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":1,"discipline":"telekinetic","useTheForce":15,"time":"Swift Action","range":"Personal","target":"You","duration":"1 round","effect":"<p>You channel the Force to enhance your next melee attack. Your next melee attack this round gains a +1d6 bonus to damage.</p>","special":"<p>This bonus damage is Force damage and bypasses Damage Reduction.</p>","descriptor":["Telekinetic"],"dcChart":[],"maintainable":false,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":94,"tags":["enhancement","damage","melee"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcepowers.f177dc6d65f76de9"}}},{"_id":"3356ef87e67fd7a6","name":"Force Slam","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":2,"discipline":"telekinetic","useTheForce":20,"time":"Standard Action","range":"6 squares","target":"One creature or object","duration":"Instantaneous","effect":"<p>You use telekinetic force to violently slam your target against a surface. The target takes 4d6 damage and is knocked prone.</p>","special":"<p>The target must be within 6 squares of a solid surface (wall, floor, ceiling).</p>","descriptor":["Telekinetic"],"dcChart":[],"maintainable":false,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":97,"tags":["attack","damage","telekinetic","prone"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcepowers.462a6c23e00c4dfc"}}},{"_id":"993c50f84a0cb5c7","name":"Force Stun","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":2,"discipline":"telepathic","useTheForce":20,"time":"Standard Action","range":"6 squares","target":"One creature","duration":"1 round","effect":"<p>You use the Force to overwhelm your target's mind, stunning them. The target must make a Will save (DC = your UTF check) or be stunned for 1 round.</p>","special":"","descriptor":["Mind-Affecting"],"dcChart":[],"maintainable":false,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":97,"tags":["attack","stun","mind-affecting"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcepowers.a214d4f56b4abe11"}}},{"_id":"7695b1eef48aab15","name":"Force Thrust","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":2,"discipline":"telekinetic","useTheForce":20,"time":"Standard Action","range":"6 squares","target":"One creature or object","duration":"Instantaneous","effect":"<p>You violently push your target away with telekinetic force. The target is pushed 6 squares away from you and knocked prone, taking 2d6 damage.</p>","special":"<p>If the target hits an obstacle during the push, they take an additional 1d6 damage per 2 squares not traveled.</p>","descriptor":["Telekinetic"],"dcChart":[],"maintainable":false,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":97,"tags":["attack","movement","telekinetic","forced-movement"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcepowers.d51bf85903366b6b"}}},{"_id":"5e9ac47f9939ca6a","name":"Move Object","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":2,"discipline":"telekinetic","useTheForce":15,"time":"Standard Action","range":"12 squares","target":"One object or creature","duration":"Concentration","effect":"<p>You move objects or creatures through the air using telekinesis. The maximum size/weight you can move depends on your Use the Force check result.</p>","special":"<p>Unwilling creatures can make a Will save (DC = your UTF check) to resist being moved.</p>","descriptor":["Telekinetic"],"dcChart":[{"dc":15,"effect":"Medium (50 kg)","description":"Move objects up to Medium size or 50 kg"},{"dc":20,"effect":"Large (250 kg)","description":"Move objects up to Large size or 250 kg"},{"dc":25,"effect":"Huge (1 ton)","description":"Move objects up to Huge size or 1 metric ton"},{"dc":30,"effect":"Gargantuan (5 tons)","description":"Move objects up to Gargantuan size or 5 metric tons"},{"dc":35,"effect":"Colossal (20 tons)","description":"Move objects up to Colossal size or 20 metric tons (starfighter-sized)"}],"maintainable":true,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":98,"tags":["telekinetic","movement","utility"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcepowers.289013a32bd179ad"}}},{"_id":"c310ee6a3fc99cac","name":"Rebuke","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":2,"discipline":"telepathic","useTheForce":20,"time":"Standard Action","range":"6 squares","target":"One Force-sensitive creature","duration":"1 round","effect":"<p>You overwhelm a Force user with a powerful Force presence. If the target is Force-sensitive, they must make a Will save (DC = your UTF check) or be dazed for 1 round.</p>","special":"<p>This power only affects Force-sensitive creatures.</p>","descriptor":["Mind-Affecting"],"dcChart":[],"maintainable":false,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":99,"tags":["debuff","force-user","daze"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcepowers.390074b44aedfa2a"}}},{"_id":"18088e6687ea402a","name":"Surge","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":1,"discipline":"vital","useTheForce":15,"time":"Swift Action","range":"Personal","target":"You","duration":"1 round","effect":"<p>You use the Force to push your body beyond normal limits. You gain an additional move action this turn.</p>","special":"<p>This extra move action can be used to move or perform other move-action tasks.</p>","descriptor":["Vital"],"dcChart":[],"maintainable":false,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":99,"tags":["enhancement","action-economy","movement"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcepowers.1ac1084ca8f07114"}}},{"_id":"126fe5599d896bc8","name":"Unarmed","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"1d4+8","damageType":"kinetic","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":1,"cost":0,"equipped":true,"description":"","properties":[],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"simple","proficiency":"simple","subcategory":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"placeholder":true,"npc":{"flatAttackBonus":17,"flatDamageFormula":"1d4+8","useFlat":true}}}},{"_id":"c7ffe2adfc62371c","name":"Lightsaber","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"2d8+10","damageType":"energy","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":1,"cost":12000,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>The elegant weapon of th